window.SITE_I18N={"de":{"What's new":"Neu","Features":"Funktionen","Pricing":"Preise","Privacy":"Datenschutz","Login":"Anmelden","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"Das komplette Archiv für<br><span>ästhetische Praxen</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Patientenfotos, Termine mit Online-Buchung, WhatsApp-Erinnerungen, Patientenportal, ICD-10-Diagnosen und Buchhaltung – auf Smartphone, Tablet und im Browser. Von einem Arzt entwickelt, für Ärzte.","Download on App Store":"Laden im App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Jetzt bei Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Alles, was Ihre Klinik braucht, in einer App","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Fotoaufnahme aus fünf Winkeln","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Vorher/Nachher-Slider & Collage","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Terminbuch & Tagesprotokoll","Online Booking Page":"Online-Buchungsseite","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Kalender für mehrere Ärzte, Räume & Geräte","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"WhatsApp- & SMS-Erinnerungen","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Links zum Bestätigen / Absagen & No-Show-Tracking","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Gesundheitsfragebogen vor dem Termin","Patient Portal":"Patientenportal","Digital Consent Forms":"Digitale Einwilligungsformulare","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"ICD-10-Diagnosen","Session Packages":"Behandlungspakete","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Buchhaltung, Ratenzahlungen & Tagesabschluss","Stock Tracking":"Lagerverwaltung","Recall Reminders":"Recall-Erinnerungen","Secure Photo Share Links":"Sichere Links zum Teilen von Fotos","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"QR-Codes für Buchung & Social Media","Branded PDF Reports":"PDF-Berichte mit Ihrem Branding","Real-Time Statistics":"Echtzeit-Statistiken","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Mehrbenutzerzugang für Praxen","Web Panel":"Web-Panel","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 Sprachen, internationale Vorwahlen","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Mobil + Web, Ihre Daten","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"Ihre Daten gehören <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">Ihnen</span>. Immer.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Keine Verkaufsdemo, keine Bindung. Erfassen Sie mit dem Smartphone, verwalten Sie in jedem Browser und exportieren Sie Ihr gesamtes Archiv, wann immer Sie möchten.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Mobil + Web-Panel","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Fotografieren Sie direkt mit dem Smartphone, prüfen und verwalten Sie alles im Web-Panel — vollständig synchronisiert.","Export Anytime":"Jederzeit exportieren","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Laden Sie Ihr komplettes Archiv — Patienten, Besuche und Fotos — als ZIP, HTML, JSON oder CSV herunter. Es gehört Ihnen.","Start in 5 Minutes":"In 5 Minuten startklar","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Herunterladen, anmelden, ersten Patienten anlegen. Kein Demo-Termin, keine Einrichtungsgebühr, kein Warten auf ein Vertriebsteam.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"Von der ersten Buchung<br>bis zur letzten Nachkontrolle","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC hat sich von einem Fotoarchiv zu einem vollständigen Kliniksystem entwickelt. Alle folgenden Funktionen stehen in der mobilen App und im Web-Panel zur Verfügung.","Online booking":"Online-Buchung","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"Ihre eigene Buchungsseite für Instagram, Google und Ihre Website. Patienten wählen Leistung, Arzt und freien Termin – der Termin erscheint sofort in Ihrem Terminbuch.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Ärzte, Räume & Geräte","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"Jeder Arzt mit eigenen Sprechzeiten und eigener Farbe. Derselbe Arzt, Raum oder Laser kann nie doppelt belegt werden – weder in der App noch online.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Bestätigen, absagen, erscheinen","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"Erinnerungen enthalten einen Link zum Bestätigen / Absagen mit einem Fingertipp. Absagen erreichen Sie sofort; die No-Show-Historie wird bei jedem Termin angezeigt.","Pre-visit health form":"Gesundheitsfragebogen vor dem Termin","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Patienten geben Allergien, Medikamente, Schwangerschaft und frühere Behandlungen vor dem Termin auf dem Smartphone an. Risiken werden auf dem Behandlungsbildschirm hervorgehoben.","Patient portal":"Patientenportal","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Ein privater Link pro Patient: anstehende Termine, Pakete, unterschriebene Einwilligungen und die Fotos, die Sie freigeben. Durch eine PIN geschützt.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"ICD-10-Diagnosen","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Durchsuchen Sie 15.000+ Codes nach Code oder Bezeichnung. Inklusive der offiziellen Liste des türkischen Gesundheitsministeriums und ästhetischer Diagnosen in 10 Sprachen.","Packages & accounting":"Pakete & Buchhaltung","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Verkaufen Sie Behandlungspakete, verfolgen Sie Raten und offene Forderungen, erfassen Sie Einnahmen und Ausgaben und schließen Sie die Kasse am Ende des Tages ab.","Photo share links":"Links zum Teilen von Fotos","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Senden Sie ausgewählte Vorher/Nachher-Fotos als privaten, zeitlich begrenzten Link an Patienten – keine Screenshots mehr in WhatsApp-Chats.","QR codes":"QR-Codes","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Druckfertige QR-Codes für Ihre Buchungsseite, Instagram, TikTok, Website, WhatsApp und Google-Bewertungen – für Empfang und Visitenkarten.","Before & After Collage":"Vorher-Nachher-Collage","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Vorher-Nachher-Collage<br>für Social Media","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Collagen mit Logo und Datum. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — jedes Seitenverhältnis, das Ihr Feed braucht.","Built for":"Entwickelt für","Plastic Surgery":"Plastische Chirurgie","Dermatology":"Dermatologie","Aesthetic Medicine":"Ästhetische Medizin","ENT":"HNO","Cosmetic Clinics":"Kosmetikpraxen","Visual Comparison Slider":"Visueller Vergleichsslider","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Ziehen, um Vorher und<br>Nachher zu vergleichen","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"Die Top-Funktion für Beratungsgespräche. Schieben Sie zwischen zwei Besuchen hin und her und zeigen Sie den Fortschritt in Echtzeit — ideal, um Patienten bei Kontrollterminen Ergebnisse zu zeigen.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Flüssiger, interaktiver Vorher-Nachher-Slider","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Ergebnis in der Fotogalerie speichern","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Standardisierte Winkel für exakte Vergleiche","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Vergleich nebeneinander","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Fünf standardisierte Winkel,<br>sofortiger Vergleich","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Frontal, links 45°, rechts 45°, Profil links, Profil rechts — das klinische Fünf-Winkel-Protokoll, das ästhetische Fachärzte weltweit nutzen. Vergleichen Sie zwei beliebige Besuche auf einen Blick.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Geister-Overlay bei der Aufnahme für gleichbleibende Winkel","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Rasteransicht zweier Besuche über alle fünf Winkel","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Ideal für Kontrolltermine","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Druckfertige Berichte<br>mit einem Tippen","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Jeder Export trägt Ihr Praxislogo, Ihre Adresse, den Arztnamen und Ihre Kontaktdaten. Automatisch formatierte, mehrseitige Berichte für Druck, WhatsApp oder E-Mail.","Clinic branding on every page":"Praxis-Branding auf jeder Seite","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Arztname, Fachrichtung und Kontakt","Share via system print or messaging":"Teilen über Systemdruck oder Messenger","Daily Patient Log":"Tägliches Patientenprotokoll","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Tagesagenda<br>und Besuchsprotokoll","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Jede Behandlung, jeder Patient, jeder Tag — automatisch protokolliert. Navigieren Sie im Kalender und sehen Sie genau, wer an welchem Tag behandelt wurde und was durchgeführt wurde.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Kalender mit markierten Behandlungstagen","Procedure list per day":"Behandlungsliste pro Tag","PDF export of any daily log":"PDF-Export jedes Tagesprotokolls","Appointment Book":"Terminbuch","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Termine mit<br>WhatsApp- & SMS-Erinnerungen","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Planen Sie Termine im Kalender und senden Sie Patienten Erinnerungen per WhatsApp oder SMS — mit einem Tippen. Passen Sie Ihre Erinnerungsnachricht pro Praxis an, für einen einheitlichen Markenauftritt.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Kalenderbasierte Terminverwaltung","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp Click-to-Chat (keine SMS-Kosten)","SMS option with customizable templates":"SMS-Option mit anpassbaren Vorlagen","Per-clinic message customization":"Nachrichten pro Praxis anpassbar","Patient Database":"Patientendatenbank","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Alle Ihre Patienten,<br>mit einem Tippen","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Schluss mit dem Durchsuchen der Kamerarolle. Jeder Patient, jeder Besuch — übersichtlich in einer Liste mit Sofortsuche.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Schnellsuche nach Vorname, Nachname oder Telefon","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"Geburtstag, Kontakt, Stadt an einem Ort","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Besuchsanzahl und Kontrollverfolgung","Clinic Dashboard":"Praxis-Dashboard","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"Ihre Praxis<br>auf einen Blick","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Patientenzahl, letzte Besuche, heutige Agenda, anstehende Termine — Ihre gesamte Praxisaktivität auf einem Startbildschirm. Speicher, Benutzer, Sprache und Branding in einem Panel konfigurieren.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Praxisstatistiken in Echtzeit","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"Bis zu 5 Teammitglieder mit rollenbasiertem Zugriff","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 Sprachen, DSGVO- & KVKK-konform","Web Browser Access":"Zugriff über Webbrowser","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Zugriff auf Ihre Daten<br>aus jedem Browser","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"Sie müssen die Daten eines ganzen Jahres herunterladen? Öffnen Sie Ihre Daten in jedem Computer-Browser. Patienten anlegen, Sicherungen erstellen und alles in mehreren Formaten exportieren — ohne Ihr Smartphone.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Verschlüsselter Download im Browser","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"JSON-, CSV-, HTML- & ZIP-Export","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Patienten, Termine, Buchhaltung und Einstellungen der Online-Buchung","Patient-organized folder structure":"Ordnerstruktur nach Patienten","Your Brand Everywhere":"Ihre Marke überall","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Logo, Adresse, Kontakt<br>in jedem Bericht","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"Ihre Praxisidentität fließt automatisch in jedes PDF und jedes geteilte Foto ein: Praxisname, Arztprofil, Fachrichtung, Kontakt und Social-Media-Kanäle. Cloud-Speicher mit automatischer nächtlicher Sicherung in Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Eigenes Praxislogo hochladen","Doctor name and specialty":"Arztname und Fachrichtung","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Telefon, Instagram, Weblink","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Automatische nächtliche Cloud-Sicherung","Simple, transparent pricing":"Einfache, transparente Preise","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Ein Abo. Alle Funktionen freigeschaltet. Jederzeit kündbar.","14-Day Free Trial":"14 Tage kostenlos testen","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"Ihr komplettes Archiv für die ästhetische Praxis.","/ month":"/ Monat","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"14 Tage kostenlos testen. Jederzeit in Ihren Kontoeinstellungen kündbar."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Unbegrenzt Patienten, Fotos & Besuche"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Aufnahme mit Geister-Overlay & Vergleichsslider"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Tägliches Patientenprotokoll & Terminbuch"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" WhatsApp- & SMS-Erinnerungen"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Online-Buchungsseite, Kalender für mehrere Ärzte"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Patientenportal, Gesundheitsfragebögen & digitale Einwilligungen"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" ICD-10-Diagnosen, Pakete, Buchhaltung & Lager"," Branded PDF reports":" PDF-Berichte mit Ihrem Branding"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Sichere Cloud-Sicherung (nächtlich)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Mehrbenutzerzugang für Praxen (bis zu 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Datenzugriff im Webbrowser & vollständiger Export"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 Sprachen, DSGVO- & KVKK-konform","Start free trial - iOS":"Kostenlos testen - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Kostenlos testen - Android","Frequently asked":"Häufige Fragen","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Alles, was Sie über AAFC wissen müssen.","Is my patient data secure?":"Sind meine Patientendaten sicher?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Ja. Alle Fotos und Patientendaten werden bei der Übertragung und im Ruhezustand verschlüsselt. AAFC speichert Daten auf der sicheren Infrastruktur von Supabase mit Row-Level Security und erstellt jede Nacht automatische Sicherungen in Cloudflare R2. Wir geben niemals Daten an Dritte oder Werbetreibende weiter. Sie können Ihre gesamten Daten jederzeit exportieren und die Löschung Ihres Kontos über unsere Löschseite beantragen.","Who is AAFC for?":"Für wen ist AAFC gedacht?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC wurde für approbierte medizinische Fachkräfte entwickelt: plastische Chirurgen, Dermatologen, HNO-Ärzte, ästhetisch tätige Ärzte und Praxisteams. Es ist ein Dokumentations- und Archivierungstool; es gibt keine Diagnose- oder Behandlungsempfehlungen.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"Wie funktionieren WhatsApp-Erinnerungen?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Tippen Sie auf den Termin eines Patienten und dann auf den WhatsApp-Button — Ihre anpassbare Erinnerungsnachricht öffnet sich direkt in WhatsApp mit bereits eingetragener Nummer des Patienten. Senden mit einem Tippen. Dabei wird WhatsApp Click-to-Chat genutzt, es entstehen also keine Kosten pro Nachricht. Sie können auch per SMS über die Nachrichten-App Ihres Smartphones senden.","Can patients book appointments online?":"Können Patienten online Termine buchen?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Ja. Aktivieren Sie die Online-Buchung, wählen Sie Leistungen, Dauer und Arbeitszeiten und teilen Sie Ihren Link oder QR-Code auf Instagram, Google und Ihrer Website. Gebuchte Zeiten werden automatisch blockiert, und an ausgebuchten Tagen können sich Patienten auf eine Warteliste setzen.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"Eignet sich die App für Kliniken mit mehreren Ärzten?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Ja. Legen Sie jeden Arzt mit eigenen Arbeitszeiten an. Termine werden einem Arzt zugeordnet, derselbe Arzt kann nicht doppelt belegt werden, und Patienten können bei der Online-Buchung einen Arzt – oder „beliebiger Arzt“ – wählen.","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"Kann ich ICD-10-Diagnosen erfassen?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Ja. Fügen Sie jedem Behandlungstermin eine oder mehrere Diagnosen hinzu – per Suche nach Code oder Bezeichnung. AAFC enthält die vollständige ICD-10-Liste, die offizielle Liste des türkischen Gesundheitsministeriums und gängige ästhetische Diagnosen in 10 Sprachen.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"Verlängert sich die 14-tägige Testphase automatisch?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"Die Testphase geht in ein kostenpflichtiges Abo für 49,99 USD pro Monat über, sofern Sie nicht vor Ende der Testphase kündigen. Sie können jederzeit in den Kontoeinstellungen von App Store oder Google Play kündigen.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"Kann ich AAFC mit meinem Team nutzen?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Ja. Mit dem Mehrbenutzerzugang für Praxen können Sie bis zu 5 Teammitglieder in Ihr Praxiskonto einladen, jeweils mit rollenbasierten Berechtigungen.","What devices does AAFC support?":"Welche Geräte unterstützt AAFC?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC läuft auf iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android-Smartphones und -Tablets (Android 7+) sowie Macs mit Apple Silicon. Das Web-Panel funktioniert in jedem Browser für Patienten, Termine, Buchhaltung, Einstellungen der Online-Buchung, Backups und Exporte.","What languages are supported?":"Welche Sprachen werden unterstützt?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC ist vollständig in 10 Sprachen lokalisiert: Türkisch, Englisch, Deutsch, Französisch, Spanisch, Italienisch, Portugiesisch, Russisch, Koreanisch und Chinesisch — einschließlich Erinnerungsvorlagen pro Praxis.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"Speichern Sie Fotos identifizierbarer Patienten?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"Sie entscheiden. AAFC ist ein Archivierungstool unter Ihrer Kontrolle. Wir empfehlen, vor dem Speichern identifizierbarer medizinischer Fotos die Einwilligung des Patienten einzuholen und die lokalen Vorschriften für medizinische Daten einzuhalten (KVKK, DSGVO, HIPAA usw.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"Bereit, Ihr klinisches Archiv zu organisieren?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Schließen Sie sich Praxen an, die sicher dokumentieren. 14 Tage kostenlos, keine Karte zum Start nötig.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. Die komplette Praxisverwaltung für ästhetische Fachkräfte.","Product":"Produkt","Legal":"Rechtliches","Privacy Policy":"Datenschutzerklärung","Terms of Service":"Nutzungsbedingungen","Account Deletion":"Kontolöschung","Contact":"Kontakt","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"Wie übernehme ich Daten aus meinem alten Programm?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"Patientenliste, Besuchsverlauf und Fotos lassen sich aus jedem Programm übernehmen. Am Computer unter aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT in 3 Schritten: 1) Patienten: Liste als Excel/CSV exportieren und hochladen; Name, Telefon, Ausweis- und alte Patientennr. zuordnen. 2) Besuchsverlauf: Behandlungs-/Sitzungsliste als Excel/CSV hochladen; jede Zeile wird mit Datum, Behandlung und Notizen dem Patienten zugeordnet. 3) Fotos: Fotoordner (oder ZIP) des alten Programms wählen; Patientenordner werden über Name oder Patientennr. zugeordnet, das Datum stammt aus Ordner-/Dateiname oder Foto, Fotos eines Tages bilden einen Besuch. Duplikate werden übersprungen, jeder Import lässt sich rückgängig machen. Kein Export möglich? Schreiben Sie an support@aafclinic.com – wir übernehmen es gemeinsam."},"es":{"What's new":"Novedades","Features":"Funciones","Pricing":"Precios","Privacy":"Privacidad","Login":"Acceder","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"El archivo completo para<br><span>clínicas estéticas</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Fotos de pacientes, citas con reserva online, recordatorios por WhatsApp, portal del paciente, diagnósticos CIE-10 y contabilidad: en su teléfono, tableta y navegador. Creado por un médico, para médicos.","Download on App Store":"Descargar en App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Disponible en Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Todo lo que su clínica necesita, en una sola app","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Captura de fotos en cinco ángulos","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Comparador antes/después y collage","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Agenda de citas y registro diario","Online Booking Page":"Página de reserva online","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Calendario multimédico, salas y equipos","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"Recordatorios por WhatsApp y SMS","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Enlaces de confirmación / cancelación y control de ausencias","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Formulario de salud previo a la visita","Patient Portal":"Portal del paciente","Digital Consent Forms":"Consentimientos digitales","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"Diagnósticos CIE-10","Session Packages":"Paquetes de sesiones","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Contabilidad, pagos a plazos y cierre de caja","Stock Tracking":"Control de stock","Recall Reminders":"Recordatorios de seguimiento","Secure Photo Share Links":"Enlaces seguros para compartir fotos","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"Códigos QR para reservas y redes sociales","Branded PDF Reports":"Informes PDF con su marca","Real-Time Statistics":"Estadísticas en tiempo real","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Acceso multiusuario para clínicas","Web Panel":"Panel web","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 idiomas, prefijos telefónicos internacionales","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Móvil + web, sus datos","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"Sus datos son <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">suyos</span>. Siempre.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Sin demos comerciales, sin permanencia. Capture con su teléfono, gestione desde cualquier navegador y exporte todo su archivo cuando quiera.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Móvil + panel web","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Fotografíe con su teléfono, revise y gestione todo desde el panel web — totalmente sincronizado.","Export Anytime":"Exporte cuando quiera","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Descargue su archivo completo — pacientes, visitas y fotos — en ZIP, HTML, JSON o CSV. Es suyo.","Start in 5 Minutes":"Empiece en 5 minutos","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Descargue, inicie sesión y añada su primer paciente. Sin llamada de demostración, sin coste de alta, sin esperar a un equipo comercial.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"Desde la primera reserva<br>hasta el último control","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC nació como un archivo de fotos y se ha convertido en un sistema completo para la clínica. Todo lo que verá a continuación funciona en la app móvil y en el panel web.","Online booking":"Reserva online","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"Su propia página de reservas para Instagram, Google y su sitio web. Los pacientes eligen servicio, médico y hora libre; la cita aparece al instante en su agenda.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Médicos, salas y equipos","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"Cada médico con su propio horario y color. El mismo médico, sala o láser nunca puede reservarse dos veces, ni en la app ni online.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Confirmar, cancelar, acudir","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"Los recordatorios incluyen un enlace para confirmar / cancelar con un solo toque. Las cancelaciones le llegan al momento; el historial de ausencias aparece en cada cita.","Pre-visit health form":"Formulario de salud previo a la visita","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Antes de la visita, los pacientes indican desde su teléfono alergias, medicación, embarazo y tratamientos previos. Los riesgos se señalan en la pantalla de la visita.","Patient portal":"Portal del paciente","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Un enlace privado por paciente: próximas citas, paquetes, consentimientos firmados y las fotos que usted decida compartir. Protegido con PIN.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"Diagnósticos CIE-10","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Busque entre 15.000+ códigos por código o nombre. Incluye la lista oficial del Ministerio de Sanidad de Turquía y diagnósticos estéticos en 10 idiomas.","Packages & accounting":"Paquetes y contabilidad","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Venda paquetes de sesiones, controle plazos y cobros pendientes, registre ingresos y gastos, y haga el cierre de caja al final del día.","Photo share links":"Enlaces para compartir fotos","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Envíe fotos de antes/después seleccionadas a un paciente mediante un enlace privado con caducidad, sin capturas de pantalla en chats de WhatsApp.","QR codes":"Códigos QR","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Códigos QR listos para imprimir para su página de reservas, Instagram, TikTok, sitio web, WhatsApp y reseñas de Google: para la recepción y las tarjetas de visita.","Before & After Collage":"Collage antes y después","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Collage antes y después<br>pensado para redes sociales","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Collages con su logotipo y fechas. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — todos los formatos que necesita su feed.","Built for":"Diseñado para","Plastic Surgery":"Cirugía plástica","Dermatology":"Dermatología","Aesthetic Medicine":"Medicina estética","ENT":"ORL","Cosmetic Clinics":"Clínicas cosméticas","Visual Comparison Slider":"Slider de comparación visual","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Deslice para comparar<br>antes y después","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"La función estrella para las consultas. Deslice entre dos visitas para mostrar la evolución en tiempo real — ideal para enseñar resultados a los pacientes en las revisiones.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Slider antes/después fluido e interactivo","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Guarde el resultado en la galería del teléfono","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Ángulos estandarizados para una comparación precisa","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Comparación lado a lado","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Cinco ángulos estandarizados,<br>comparación al instante","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Frontal, izquierda 45°, derecha 45°, perfil izquierdo, perfil derecho — el protocolo clínico de cinco ángulos que usan los profesionales de la estética en todo el mundo. Compare dos visitas cualesquiera de un vistazo.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Superposición fantasma durante la captura para mantener el ángulo","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Vista en cuadrícula de dos visitas en los cinco ángulos","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Ideal para consultas de revisión","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Informes listos para imprimir<br>con un toque","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Cada exportación lleva el logotipo, la dirección, el nombre del médico y los datos de contacto de su clínica. Informes de varias páginas con formato automático, listos para imprimir, enviar por WhatsApp o por correo electrónico.","Clinic branding on every page":"Marca de la clínica en cada página","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Nombre del médico, especialidad y contacto","Share via system print or messaging":"Comparta mediante impresión del sistema o mensajería","Daily Patient Log":"Registro diario de pacientes","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Agenda diaria<br>y registro de visitas","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Cada procedimiento, cada paciente, cada día — registrado automáticamente. Navegue por el calendario para ver exactamente a quién se trató y qué se realizó en cualquier día.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Calendario con días de tratamiento marcados","Procedure list per day":"Lista de procedimientos por día","PDF export of any daily log":"Exportación en PDF de cualquier registro diario","Appointment Book":"Agenda de citas","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Citas con recordatorios<br>por WhatsApp y SMS","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Programe citas en un calendario y envíe recordatorios a los pacientes por WhatsApp o SMS — con un toque. Personalice el mensaje de recordatorio de cada clínica para mantener una voz de marca coherente.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Gestión de citas basada en calendario","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"Click-to-chat de WhatsApp (sin coste de SMS)","SMS option with customizable templates":"Opción de SMS con plantillas personalizables","Per-clinic message customization":"Mensajes personalizados por clínica","Patient Database":"Base de datos de pacientes","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Todos sus pacientes,<br>a un toque","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Deje de buscar en el carrete de la cámara. Cada paciente y cada visita, organizados en una lista clara con búsqueda instantánea.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Búsqueda rápida por nombre, apellidos o teléfono","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"Cumpleaños, contacto y ciudad en un solo lugar","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Recuento de visitas y seguimiento de revisiones","Clinic Dashboard":"Panel de la clínica","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"Su clínica<br>de un vistazo","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Número de pacientes, visitas recientes, agenda de hoy, próximas citas — toda la actividad de su clínica en una sola pantalla de inicio. Configure almacenamiento, usuarios, idioma y marca desde un único panel.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Estadísticas de la clínica en tiempo real","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"Hasta 5 miembros del equipo con acceso por roles","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 idiomas, conforme con RGPD y KVKK","Web Browser Access":"Acceso desde el navegador","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Acceda a sus datos<br>desde cualquier navegador","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"¿Necesita descargar un año de registros? Abra sus datos en el navegador de cualquier ordenador. Añada pacientes, haga copias de seguridad y exporte todo en varios formatos — sin tocar el teléfono.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Descarga cifrada en el navegador","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"Exportación en JSON, CSV, HTML y ZIP","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Pacientes, citas, contabilidad y ajustes de reserva online","Patient-organized folder structure":"Estructura de carpetas por paciente","Your Brand Everywhere":"Su marca en todas partes","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Logotipo, dirección y contacto<br>en cada informe","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"La identidad de su clínica se incorpora automáticamente a cada PDF y foto compartida: nombre de la clínica, perfil del médico, especialidad, contacto y redes sociales. Almacenamiento en la nube con copia de seguridad automática cada noche en Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Suba el logotipo de su clínica","Doctor name and specialty":"Nombre del médico y especialidad","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Teléfono, Instagram, enlace web","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Copia de seguridad automática nocturna en la nube","Simple, transparent pricing":"Precios sencillos y transparentes","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Una suscripción. Todas las funciones incluidas. Cancele cuando quiera.","14-Day Free Trial":"Prueba gratuita de 14 días","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"El archivo completo para su clínica estética.","/ month":"/ mes","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"Pruébelo gratis durante 14 días. Cancele cuando quiera desde los ajustes de su cuenta."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Pacientes, fotos y visitas ilimitados"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Captura con superposición fantasma y slider de comparación"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Registro diario de pacientes y agenda de citas"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" Recordatorios por WhatsApp y SMS"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Página de reserva online, calendario multimédico"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Portal del paciente, formularios de salud y consentimientos digitales"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" Diagnósticos CIE-10, paquetes, contabilidad y stock"," Branded PDF reports":" Informes PDF con su marca"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Copia de seguridad segura en la nube (cada noche)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Acceso multiusuario para clínicas (hasta 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Acceso a datos desde el navegador y exportación completa"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 idiomas, conforme con RGPD y KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"Iniciar prueba gratuita - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Iniciar prueba gratuita - Android","Frequently asked":"Preguntas frecuentes","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Todo lo que necesita saber sobre AAFC.","Is my patient data secure?":"¿Están seguros los datos de mis pacientes?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Sí. Todas las fotos y los registros de pacientes se cifran en tránsito y en reposo. AAFC almacena los datos en la infraestructura segura de Supabase con seguridad a nivel de fila y realiza copias de seguridad automáticas cada noche en Cloudflare R2. Nunca compartimos datos con terceros ni anunciantes. Puede exportar todos sus datos en cualquier momento y solicitar la eliminación de su cuenta desde nuestra página de eliminación.","Who is AAFC for?":"¿Para quién es AAFC?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC está diseñado para profesionales sanitarios colegiados: cirujanos plásticos, dermatólogos, otorrinolaringólogos, médicos estéticos y equipos de clínica. Es una herramienta de documentación y archivo; no ofrece orientación diagnóstica ni terapéutica.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"¿Cómo funcionan los recordatorios por WhatsApp?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Toque la cita de un paciente y luego el botón de WhatsApp — su mensaje de recordatorio personalizable se abre directamente en WhatsApp con el número del paciente ya introducido. Envíelo con un toque. Se utiliza el click-to-chat de WhatsApp, por lo que no hay coste por mensaje. También puede enviarlo por SMS con la app de mensajes de su teléfono.","Can patients book appointments online?":"¿Pueden los pacientes reservar citas online?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Sí. Active la reserva online, elija sus servicios, duraciones y horario de trabajo, y comparta su enlace o código QR en Instagram, Google y su sitio web. Las horas reservadas se bloquean automáticamente y, cuando un día está completo, los pacientes pueden apuntarse a una lista de espera.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"¿Funciona en clínicas con varios médicos?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Sí. Añada cada médico con su propio horario de trabajo. Las citas se asignan a un médico, el mismo médico no puede tener citas solapadas y, al reservar online, los pacientes pueden elegir un médico o «cualquier médico».","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"¿Puedo registrar diagnósticos CIE-10?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Sí. Añada uno o varios diagnósticos a cualquier visita buscando por código o nombre. AAFC incluye la lista CIE-10 completa, la lista oficial del Ministerio de Sanidad de Turquía y los diagnósticos estéticos más habituales en 10 idiomas.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"¿La prueba gratuita de 14 días se renueva automáticamente?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"La prueba se convierte en una suscripción de pago de 49,99 USD al mes, salvo que la cancele antes de que termine. Puede cancelarla en cualquier momento desde los ajustes de su cuenta de App Store o Google Play.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"¿Puedo usar AAFC con mi equipo?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Sí. La función de acceso multiusuario para clínicas le permite invitar hasta 5 miembros del equipo a la cuenta de su clínica, cada uno con permisos según su rol.","What devices does AAFC support?":"¿Qué dispositivos admite AAFC?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC funciona en iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, teléfonos y tabletas Android (Android 7+) y Mac con Apple Silicon. El panel web funciona en cualquier navegador para pacientes, citas, contabilidad, ajustes de reserva online, copias de seguridad y exportaciones.","What languages are supported?":"¿Qué idiomas están disponibles?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC está totalmente localizado en 10 idiomas: turco, inglés, alemán, francés, español, italiano, portugués, ruso, coreano y chino — incluidas las plantillas de recordatorio por clínica.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"¿Almacenan fotos de pacientes identificables?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"Usted decide. AAFC es una herramienta de archivo bajo su control. Le recomendamos obtener el consentimiento del paciente antes de almacenar fotos médicas identificables y cumplir la normativa local sobre datos médicos (KVKK, RGPD, HIPAA, etc.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"¿Listo para organizar su archivo clínico?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Únase a las clínicas que documentan con confianza. 14 días gratis, sin tarjeta para empezar.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. La gestión clínica completa para profesionales de la estética.","Product":"Producto","Legal":"Legal","Privacy Policy":"Política de privacidad","Terms of Service":"Términos del servicio","Account Deletion":"Eliminación de cuenta","Contact":"Contacto","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"¿Cómo traigo mis datos del programa anterior?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"La lista de pacientes, el historial de visitas y las fotos se pueden traer de cualquier programa. En un ordenador, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORTAR, en 3 pasos: 1) Pacientes: exporte la lista a Excel/CSV y súbala; empareje nombre, teléfono, documento y n.º de paciente antiguo. 2) Historial de visitas: suba la lista de tratamientos/sesiones en Excel/CSV; cada fila se añade a su paciente con fecha, procedimiento y notas. 3) Fotos: elija la carpeta (o ZIP) de fotos del programa anterior; las carpetas se asocian por nombre o n.º de paciente, la fecha sale del nombre de carpeta/archivo o de la foto, y las fotos del mismo día forman una visita. Los duplicados se omiten y cada importación se puede deshacer. Si no puede exportar, escriba a support@aafclinic.com y lo migramos juntos."},"fr":{"What's new":"Nouveautés","Features":"Fonctionnalités","Pricing":"Tarifs","Privacy":"Confidentialité","Login":"Connexion","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"L'archive complète pour<br><span>les cliniques esthétiques</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Photos des patients, rendez-vous avec réservation en ligne, rappels WhatsApp, portail patient, diagnostics CIM-10 et comptabilité — sur votre téléphone, votre tablette et dans le navigateur. Conçu par un médecin, pour les médecins.","Download on App Store":"Télécharger dans l'App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Disponible sur Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Tout ce dont votre clinique a besoin, dans une seule app","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Capture photo sous cinq angles","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Curseur avant/après & collage","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Agenda des rendez-vous & journal quotidien","Online Booking Page":"Page de réservation en ligne","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Agenda multi-praticiens, salles & appareils","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"Rappels WhatsApp et SMS","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Liens de confirmation / d’annulation & suivi des absences","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Questionnaire de santé avant la consultation","Patient Portal":"Portail patient","Digital Consent Forms":"Formulaires de consentement numériques","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"Diagnostics CIM-10","Session Packages":"Forfaits de séances","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Comptabilité, paiements échelonnés & clôture de caisse","Stock Tracking":"Gestion des stocks","Recall Reminders":"Rappels de suivi","Secure Photo Share Links":"Liens sécurisés de partage de photos","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"QR codes pour la réservation & les réseaux sociaux","Branded PDF Reports":"Rapports PDF personnalisés","Real-Time Statistics":"Statistiques en temps réel","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Accès multi-utilisateurs pour la clinique","Web Panel":"Panneau web","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 langues, indicatifs téléphoniques internationaux","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Mobile + Web, vos données","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"Vos données vous <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">appartiennent</span>. Toujours.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Pas de démo commerciale, aucun engagement. Prenez les photos sur votre téléphone, gérez tout depuis n'importe quel navigateur et exportez l'intégralité de votre archive quand vous le souhaitez.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Mobile + panneau web","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Photographiez au cabinet avec votre téléphone, consultez et gérez tout depuis le panneau web — entièrement synchronisé.","Export Anytime":"Export à tout moment","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Téléchargez toute votre archive — patients, visites et photos — en ZIP, HTML, JSON ou CSV. Elle vous appartient.","Start in 5 Minutes":"Opérationnel en 5 minutes","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Téléchargez, connectez-vous, ajoutez votre premier patient. Pas d'appel de démo, pas de frais de mise en route, pas d'attente d'une équipe commerciale.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"De la première réservation<br>au dernier suivi","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"D’archive photo, AAFC est devenu un système complet de gestion de clinique. Toutes les fonctions ci-dessous sont disponibles dans l’application mobile et dans le panneau web.","Online booking":"Réservation en ligne","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"Votre propre page de réservation pour Instagram, Google et votre site web. Les patients choisissent une prestation, un médecin et un créneau libre ; le rendez-vous apparaît instantanément dans votre agenda.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Médecins, salles & appareils","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"Chaque médecin avec ses propres horaires et sa couleur. Un même médecin, une même salle ou un même laser ne peut jamais être réservé deux fois — ni dans l’app, ni en ligne.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Confirmer, annuler, venir","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"Les rappels contiennent un lien de confirmation / d’annulation en un seul geste. Les annulations vous parviennent immédiatement ; l’historique des absences s’affiche sur chaque rendez-vous.","Pre-visit health form":"Questionnaire de santé avant la consultation","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Avant la consultation, les patients renseignent sur leur téléphone allergies, traitements, grossesse et interventions antérieures. Les risques sont signalés sur l’écran de la consultation.","Patient portal":"Portail patient","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Un lien privé par patient : rendez-vous à venir, forfaits, consentements signés et les photos que vous choisissez de partager. Protégé par un code PIN.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"Diagnostics CIM-10","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Recherchez parmi 15 000+ codes par code ou par libellé. Inclut la liste officielle du ministère turc de la Santé et des diagnostics esthétiques en 10 langues.","Packages & accounting":"Forfaits & comptabilité","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Vendez des forfaits de séances, suivez les échéances et les créances, enregistrez recettes et dépenses, et clôturez la caisse en fin de journée.","Photo share links":"Liens de partage de photos","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Envoyez à un patient une sélection de photos avant/après via un lien privé à durée limitée — fini les captures d’écran dans les conversations WhatsApp.","QR codes":"QR codes","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Des QR codes prêts à imprimer pour votre page de réservation, Instagram, TikTok, votre site web, WhatsApp et les avis Google — pour l’accueil et les cartes de visite.","Before & After Collage":"Collage avant & après","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Collage avant / après<br>conçu pour les réseaux sociaux","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Collages à vos couleurs avec logo et dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — tous les formats dont votre fil a besoin.","Built for":"Conçu pour","Plastic Surgery":"Chirurgie plastique","Dermatology":"Dermatologie","Aesthetic Medicine":"Médecine esthétique","ENT":"ORL","Cosmetic Clinics":"Cliniques esthétiques","Visual Comparison Slider":"Curseur de comparaison visuelle","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Faites glisser pour comparer<br>avant et après","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"La fonctionnalité phare pour les consultations. Glissez entre deux visites pour révéler l'évolution en temps réel — idéal pour montrer les résultats aux patients lors des suivis.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Curseur avant/après fluide et interactif","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Enregistrez le résultat dans la galerie de votre téléphone","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Angles standardisés pour une comparaison fiable","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Comparaison côte à côte","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Cinq angles standardisés,<br>comparaison instantanée","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Face, gauche 45°, droite 45°, profil gauche, profil droit — le protocole clinique à cinq angles utilisé par les professionnels de l'esthétique du monde entier. Comparez deux visites d'un seul coup d'œil.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Superposition fantôme lors de la prise de vue pour des angles constants","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Grille de deux visites sur les cinq angles","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Idéal pour les consultations de suivi","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Des rapports prêts à imprimer<br>en un geste","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Chaque export porte le logo, l'adresse, le nom du médecin et les coordonnées de votre clinique. Rapports multipages mis en forme automatiquement, prêts pour l'impression, WhatsApp ou l'e-mail.","Clinic branding on every page":"L'identité de votre clinique sur chaque page","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Nom du médecin, spécialité et coordonnées","Share via system print or messaging":"Partage via l'impression système ou la messagerie","Daily Patient Log":"Journal quotidien des patients","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Agenda du jour<br>et journal des visites","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Chaque acte, chaque patient, chaque jour — enregistré automatiquement. Parcourez le calendrier pour voir précisément qui a été traité et quels actes ont été réalisés à une date donnée.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Calendrier avec les jours de soins signalés","Procedure list per day":"Liste des actes par jour","PDF export of any daily log":"Export PDF de n'importe quel journal quotidien","Appointment Book":"Agenda des rendez-vous","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Rendez-vous avec<br>rappels WhatsApp et SMS","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Planifiez les rendez-vous dans un calendrier et envoyez des rappels aux patients par WhatsApp ou SMS — en un geste. Personnalisez le message de rappel de votre clinique pour une communication cohérente.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Gestion des rendez-vous par calendrier","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp click-to-chat (aucun coût SMS)","SMS option with customizable templates":"Option SMS avec modèles personnalisables","Per-clinic message customization":"Personnalisation des messages par clinique","Patient Database":"Base de données patients","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Tous vos patients,<br>en un geste","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Fini les recherches dans la pellicule. Chaque patient, chaque visite, organisés dans une liste claire avec recherche instantanée.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Recherche rapide par prénom, nom ou téléphone","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"Date de naissance, coordonnées et ville au même endroit","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Nombre de visites et suivi","Clinic Dashboard":"Tableau de bord de la clinique","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"Votre clinique<br>en un coup d'œil","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Nombre de patients, visites récentes, agenda du jour, rendez-vous à venir — toute l'activité de votre clinique sur un seul écran d'accueil. Configurez le stockage, les utilisateurs, la langue et l'identité visuelle depuis un seul panneau.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Statistiques de la clinique en temps réel","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"Jusqu'à 5 membres de l'équipe avec accès par rôle","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 langues, conforme au RGPD et au KVKK","Web Browser Access":"Accès depuis un navigateur","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Accédez à vos données<br>depuis n'importe quel navigateur","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"Besoin de télécharger une année de dossiers ? Ouvrez vos données dans le navigateur de n'importe quel ordinateur. Ajoutez des patients, lancez des sauvegardes et exportez tout en plusieurs formats — sans toucher à votre téléphone.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Téléchargement chiffré côté navigateur","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"Exports JSON, CSV, HTML et ZIP","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Patients, rendez-vous, comptabilité et paramètres de réservation en ligne","Patient-organized folder structure":"Arborescence de dossiers par patient","Your Brand Everywhere":"Votre marque partout","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Logo, adresse, coordonnées<br>sur chaque rapport","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"L'identité de votre clinique s'intègre automatiquement à chaque PDF et photo partagée : nom de la clinique, profil du médecin, spécialité, coordonnées et réseaux sociaux. Stockage cloud avec sauvegarde automatique chaque nuit vers Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Importez le logo de votre clinique","Doctor name and specialty":"Nom et spécialité du médecin","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Téléphone, Instagram, lien web","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Sauvegarde cloud automatique chaque nuit","Simple, transparent pricing":"Des tarifs simples et transparents","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Un seul abonnement. Toutes les fonctionnalités incluses. Résiliable à tout moment.","14-Day Free Trial":"Essai gratuit de 14 jours","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"L'archive complète de votre clinique esthétique.","/ month":"/ mois","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"Essai gratuit de 14 jours. Résiliable à tout moment dans les réglages de votre compte."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Patients, photos et visites illimités"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Prise de vue avec superposition fantôme et curseur de comparaison"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Journal quotidien des patients et agenda des rendez-vous"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" Rappels WhatsApp et SMS"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Page de réservation en ligne, agenda multi-praticiens"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Portail patient, questionnaires de santé & consentements numériques"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" Diagnostics CIM-10, forfaits, comptabilité & stocks"," Branded PDF reports":" Rapports PDF personnalisés"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Sauvegarde cloud sécurisée (chaque nuit)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Accès multi-utilisateurs pour la clinique (jusqu'à 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Accès aux données depuis un navigateur et export complet"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 langues, conforme au RGPD et au KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"Commencer l'essai gratuit - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Commencer l'essai gratuit - Android","Frequently asked":"Questions fréquentes","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Tout ce que vous devez savoir sur AAFC.","Is my patient data secure?":"Mes données patients sont-elles sécurisées ?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Oui. Toutes les photos et tous les dossiers patients sont chiffrés en transit et au repos. AAFC stocke les données sur l'infrastructure sécurisée de Supabase avec sécurité au niveau des lignes, et effectue des sauvegardes automatiques chaque nuit vers Cloudflare R2. Nous ne partageons jamais de données avec des tiers ou des annonceurs. Vous pouvez exporter l'intégralité de vos données à tout moment et demander la suppression de votre compte via notre page dédiée.","Who is AAFC for?":"À qui s'adresse AAFC ?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC est conçu pour les professionnels de santé diplômés : chirurgiens plasticiens, dermatologues, ORL, médecins esthétiques et équipes de clinique. C'est un outil de documentation et d'archivage ; il ne fournit aucune aide au diagnostic ni recommandation thérapeutique.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"Comment fonctionnent les rappels WhatsApp ?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Touchez le rendez-vous d'un patient, puis le bouton WhatsApp — votre message de rappel personnalisable s'ouvre directement dans WhatsApp avec le numéro du patient prérempli. Envoi en un geste. Cela utilise le click-to-chat de WhatsApp : aucun coût par message. Vous pouvez aussi envoyer un SMS via la messagerie native de votre téléphone.","Can patients book appointments online?":"Les patients peuvent-ils prendre rendez-vous en ligne ?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Oui. Activez la réservation en ligne, choisissez vos prestations, leurs durées et vos horaires, puis partagez votre lien ou votre QR code sur Instagram, Google et votre site web. Les créneaux réservés sont bloqués automatiquement, et les patients peuvent s’inscrire sur une liste d’attente lorsqu’une journée est complète.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"Convient-il aux cliniques avec plusieurs médecins ?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Oui. Ajoutez chaque médecin avec ses propres horaires. Les rendez-vous sont attribués à un médecin, un même médecin ne peut pas être réservé deux fois, et les patients peuvent choisir un médecin — ou « n’importe quel médecin » — lors de la réservation en ligne.","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"Puis-je enregistrer des diagnostics CIM-10 ?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Oui. Ajoutez un ou plusieurs diagnostics à chaque consultation en recherchant par code ou par libellé. AAFC inclut la liste CIM-10 complète, la liste officielle du ministère turc de la Santé et les diagnostics esthétiques courants en 10 langues.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"L'essai gratuit de 14 jours est-il renouvelé automatiquement ?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"L'essai se transforme en abonnement payant de 49,99 USD par mois, sauf si vous résiliez avant la fin de l'essai. Vous pouvez résilier à tout moment dans les réglages de votre compte App Store ou Google Play.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"Puis-je utiliser AAFC avec mon équipe ?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Oui. La fonction d'accès multi-utilisateurs vous permet d'inviter jusqu'à 5 membres de l'équipe sur le compte de votre clinique, chacun avec des autorisations selon son rôle.","What devices does AAFC support?":"Sur quels appareils AAFC fonctionne-t-il ?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC fonctionne sur iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, smartphones et tablettes Android (Android 7+) et Mac équipés d’Apple Silicon. Le panneau web fonctionne dans n’importe quel navigateur pour les patients, les rendez-vous, la comptabilité, les paramètres de réservation en ligne, les sauvegardes et les exports.","What languages are supported?":"Quelles langues sont prises en charge ?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC est entièrement traduit en 10 langues : turc, anglais, allemand, français, espagnol, italien, portugais, russe, coréen et chinois — y compris les modèles de messages de rappel par clinique.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"Stockez-vous des photos de patients identifiables ?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"C'est vous qui décidez. AAFC est un outil d'archivage que vous contrôlez. Nous recommandons d'obtenir le consentement du patient avant de conserver des photos médicales identifiables et de respecter la réglementation locale sur les données de santé (KVKK, RGPD, HIPAA, etc.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"Prêt à organiser votre archive clinique ?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Rejoignez les cliniques qui documentent en toute confiance. 14 jours gratuits, sans carte bancaire pour commencer.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. La solution complète de gestion de clinique pour les professionnels de l'esthétique.","Product":"Produit","Legal":"Mentions légales","Privacy Policy":"Politique de confidentialité","Terms of Service":"Conditions d'utilisation","Account Deletion":"Suppression du compte","Contact":"Contact","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"Comment reprendre les données de mon ancien logiciel ?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"Liste des patients, historique des visites et photos peuvent être repris de n'importe quel logiciel. Sur ordinateur, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORTER, en 3 étapes : 1) Patients : exportez la liste en Excel/CSV et chargez-la ; associez nom, téléphone, n° d'identité et ancien n° patient. 2) Historique des visites : chargez la liste des soins/séances en Excel/CSV ; chaque ligne est ajoutée au patient avec date, acte et notes. 3) Photos : choisissez le dossier (ou ZIP) photos de l'ancien logiciel ; les dossiers patients sont associés par nom ou n° patient, la date vient du nom du dossier/fichier ou de la photo, et les photos d'un même jour forment une visite. Les doublons sont ignorés et chaque import peut être annulé. Impossible d'exporter ? Écrivez à support@aafclinic.com, nous migrerons ensemble."},"it":{"What's new":"Novità","Features":"Funzionalità","Pricing":"Prezzi","Privacy":"Privacy","Login":"Accedi","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"L'archivio completo per<br><span>le cliniche estetiche</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Foto dei pazienti, appuntamenti con prenotazione online, promemoria WhatsApp, portale paziente, diagnosi ICD-10 e contabilità — su smartphone, tablet e nel browser. Creato da un medico, per i medici.","Download on App Store":"Scarica su App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Disponibile su Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Tutto ciò che serve alla Sua clinica, in un’unica app","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Acquisizione foto da cinque angolazioni","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Slider prima/dopo e collage","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Agenda appuntamenti e registro giornaliero","Online Booking Page":"Pagina di prenotazione online","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Calendario multi-medico, sale e apparecchiature","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"Promemoria WhatsApp e SMS","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Link di conferma / disdetta e monitoraggio delle assenze","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Modulo sanitario pre-visita","Patient Portal":"Portale paziente","Digital Consent Forms":"Moduli di consenso digitali","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"Diagnosi ICD-10","Session Packages":"Pacchetti di sedute","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Contabilità, rate e chiusura di cassa","Stock Tracking":"Gestione magazzino","Recall Reminders":"Promemoria di richiamo","Secure Photo Share Links":"Link sicuri per la condivisione delle foto","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"Codici QR per prenotazioni e social media","Branded PDF Reports":"Report PDF personalizzati","Real-Time Statistics":"Statistiche in tempo reale","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Accesso multiutente per la clinica","Web Panel":"Pannello web","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 lingue, prefissi telefonici internazionali","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Mobile + Web, i Suoi dati","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"I Suoi dati sono <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">Suoi</span>. Sempre.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Nessuna demo commerciale, nessun vincolo. Scatti con lo smartphone, gestisca tutto da qualsiasi browser ed esporti l'intero archivio quando vuole.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Mobile + pannello web","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Scatti in ambulatorio con lo smartphone, riveda e gestisca tutto dal pannello web — completamente sincronizzato.","Export Anytime":"Esportazione in qualsiasi momento","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Scarichi l'intero archivio — pazienti, visite e foto — in formato ZIP, HTML, JSON o CSV. Resta Suo.","Start in 5 Minutes":"Operativo in 5 minuti","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Scarichi l'app, acceda, aggiunga il primo paziente. Nessuna chiamata demo, nessun costo di attivazione, nessuna attesa del team commerciale.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"Dalla prima prenotazione<br>all’ultimo controllo","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC è nato come archivio fotografico ed è diventato un sistema completo per la clinica. Tutto ciò che segue funziona nell’app mobile e nel pannello web.","Online booking":"Prenotazione online","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"La Sua pagina di prenotazione per Instagram, Google e il Suo sito web. I pazienti scelgono servizio, medico e orario libero; l’appuntamento compare subito nella Sua agenda.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Medici, sale e apparecchiature","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"Ogni medico con i propri orari e il proprio colore. Lo stesso medico, la stessa sala o lo stesso laser non possono mai essere prenotati due volte — né nell’app né online.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Conferma, disdetta, presenza","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"I promemoria contengono un link per confermare / disdire con un tocco. Le disdette Le arrivano subito; lo storico delle assenze è visibile su ogni appuntamento.","Pre-visit health form":"Modulo sanitario pre-visita","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Prima della visita i pazienti indicano dal telefono allergie, farmaci, gravidanza e trattamenti precedenti. I rischi vengono segnalati nella schermata della visita.","Patient portal":"Portale paziente","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Un link privato per ogni paziente: prossimi appuntamenti, pacchetti, consensi firmati e le foto che Lei sceglie di condividere. Protetto da PIN.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"Diagnosi ICD-10","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Cerchi tra 15.000+ codici per codice o nome. Include l’elenco ufficiale del Ministero della Salute turco e diagnosi estetiche in 10 lingue.","Packages & accounting":"Pacchetti e contabilità","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Venda pacchetti di sedute, monitori rate e crediti, registri entrate e uscite e chiuda la cassa a fine giornata.","Photo share links":"Link di condivisione foto","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Invii al paziente le foto prima/dopo selezionate tramite un link privato con scadenza — niente più screenshot nelle chat di WhatsApp.","QR codes":"Codici QR","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Codici QR pronti per la stampa per la Sua pagina di prenotazione, Instagram, TikTok, sito web, WhatsApp e recensioni Google — per la reception e i biglietti da visita.","Before & After Collage":"Collage prima e dopo","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Collage prima e dopo<br>pensato per i social","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Collage personalizzati con logo e date. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — tutti i formati di cui il Suo feed ha bisogno.","Built for":"Pensato per","Plastic Surgery":"Chirurgia plastica","Dermatology":"Dermatologia","Aesthetic Medicine":"Medicina estetica","ENT":"ORL","Cosmetic Clinics":"Cliniche estetiche","Visual Comparison Slider":"Cursore di confronto visivo","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Trascini per confrontare<br>prima e dopo","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"La funzione chiave per le consulenze. Scorra tra due visite per mostrare i progressi in tempo reale — ideale per illustrare i risultati ai pazienti durante i controlli.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Cursore prima/dopo fluido e interattivo","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Salvi il risultato nella galleria del telefono","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Angolazioni standardizzate per un confronto accurato","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Confronto affiancato","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Cinque angolazioni standardizzate,<br>confronto immediato","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Frontale, sinistra 45°, destra 45°, profilo sinistro, profilo destro — il protocollo clinico a cinque angolazioni usato dai professionisti dell'estetica in tutto il mondo. Confronti due visite con un solo colpo d'occhio.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Sovrapposizione in trasparenza durante lo scatto per angolazioni coerenti","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Griglia a due visite su tutte e cinque le angolazioni","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Ideale per le visite di controllo","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Report pronti per la stampa<br>con un tocco","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Ogni esportazione riporta logo, indirizzo, nome del medico e recapiti della Sua clinica. Report multipagina formattati automaticamente, pronti per la stampa, WhatsApp o e-mail.","Clinic branding on every page":"Il marchio della clinica su ogni pagina","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Nome del medico, specializzazione e recapiti","Share via system print or messaging":"Condivisione tramite stampa di sistema o messaggistica","Daily Patient Log":"Registro giornaliero dei pazienti","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Agenda giornaliera<br>e registro visite","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Ogni trattamento, ogni paziente, ogni giorno — registrato automaticamente. Scorra il calendario per vedere esattamente chi è stato trattato e quali trattamenti sono stati eseguiti in un determinato giorno.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Calendario con i giorni di trattamento evidenziati","Procedure list per day":"Elenco dei trattamenti per giorno","PDF export of any daily log":"Esportazione PDF di qualsiasi registro giornaliero","Appointment Book":"Agenda appuntamenti","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Appuntamenti con<br>promemoria WhatsApp e SMS","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Pianifichi gli appuntamenti in un calendario e invii promemoria ai pazienti via WhatsApp o SMS — con un tocco. Personalizzi il messaggio di promemoria della clinica per una comunicazione coerente.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Gestione degli appuntamenti su calendario","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp click-to-chat (nessun costo SMS)","SMS option with customizable templates":"Opzione SMS con modelli personalizzabili","Per-clinic message customization":"Messaggi personalizzabili per clinica","Patient Database":"Database pazienti","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Tutti i Suoi pazienti,<br>a portata di tocco","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Basta cercare nel rullino. Ogni paziente, ogni visita, organizzati in un unico elenco ordinato con ricerca istantanea.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Ricerca rapida per nome, cognome o telefono","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"Data di nascita, recapiti e città in un unico posto","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Numero di visite e follow-up","Clinic Dashboard":"Dashboard della clinica","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"La Sua clinica<br>a colpo d'occhio","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Numero di pazienti, visite recenti, agenda del giorno, prossimi appuntamenti — tutta l'attività della clinica in un'unica schermata. Configuri archiviazione, utenti, lingua e branding da un unico pannello.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Statistiche della clinica in tempo reale","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"Fino a 5 membri del team con accesso basato sui ruoli","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 lingue, conforme a GDPR e KVKK","Web Browser Access":"Accesso da browser","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Acceda ai Suoi dati<br>da qualsiasi browser","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"Deve scaricare un anno di cartelle? Apra i Suoi dati nel browser di qualsiasi computer. Aggiunga pazienti, esegua backup ed esporti tutto in più formati — senza toccare il telefono.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Download crittografato lato browser","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"Esportazioni JSON, CSV, HTML e ZIP","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Pazienti, appuntamenti, contabilità e impostazioni della prenotazione online","Patient-organized folder structure":"Struttura di cartelle per paziente","Your Brand Everywhere":"Il Suo marchio ovunque","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Logo, indirizzo, recapiti<br>su ogni report","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"L'identità della Sua clinica compare automaticamente in ogni PDF e foto condivisa: nome della clinica, profilo del medico, specializzazione, recapiti e canali social. Archiviazione cloud con backup automatico ogni notte su Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Caricamento del logo della clinica","Doctor name and specialty":"Nome e specializzazione del medico","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Telefono, Instagram, link al sito","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Backup cloud automatico ogni notte","Simple, transparent pricing":"Prezzi semplici e trasparenti","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Un solo abbonamento. Tutte le funzionalità incluse. Disdetta in qualsiasi momento.","14-Day Free Trial":"Prova gratuita di 14 giorni","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"L'archivio completo della Sua clinica estetica.","/ month":"/ mese","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"Provi gratis per 14 giorni. Disdetta in qualsiasi momento dalle impostazioni dell'account."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Pazienti, foto e visite illimitati"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Acquisizione con sovrapposizione in trasparenza e cursore di confronto"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Registro giornaliero dei pazienti e agenda appuntamenti"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" Promemoria WhatsApp e SMS"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Pagina di prenotazione online, calendario multi-medico"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Portale paziente, moduli sanitari e consensi digitali"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" Diagnosi ICD-10, pacchetti, contabilità e magazzino"," Branded PDF reports":" Report PDF personalizzati"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Backup cloud sicuro (ogni notte)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Accesso multiutente per la clinica (fino a 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Accesso ai dati da browser ed esportazione completa"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 lingue, conforme a GDPR e KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"Inizia la prova gratuita - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Inizia la prova gratuita - Android","Frequently asked":"Domande frequenti","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Tutto ciò che c'è da sapere su AAFC.","Is my patient data secure?":"I dati dei miei pazienti sono al sicuro?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Sì. Tutte le foto e le cartelle dei pazienti sono crittografate in transito e a riposo. AAFC archivia i dati sull'infrastruttura sicura di Supabase con sicurezza a livello di riga ed esegue backup automatici ogni notte su Cloudflare R2. Non condividiamo mai i dati con terze parti o inserzionisti. Può esportare tutti i Suoi dati in qualsiasi momento e richiedere l'eliminazione dell'account tramite la nostra pagina dedicata.","Who is AAFC for?":"A chi è rivolto AAFC?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC è pensato per professionisti sanitari abilitati: chirurghi plastici, dermatologi, otorinolaringoiatri, medici estetici e team di clinica. È uno strumento di documentazione e archiviazione; non fornisce indicazioni diagnostiche o terapeutiche.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"Come funzionano i promemoria WhatsApp?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Tocchi l'appuntamento di un paziente, poi il pulsante WhatsApp — il Suo messaggio di promemoria personalizzabile si apre direttamente in WhatsApp con il numero del paziente già inserito. Invio con un tocco. Viene usata la funzione click-to-chat di WhatsApp, quindi non c'è alcun costo per messaggio. Può anche inviare un SMS con l'app di messaggistica del telefono.","Can patients book appointments online?":"I pazienti possono prenotare appuntamenti online?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Sì. Attivi la prenotazione online, scelga servizi, durate e orari di lavoro e condivida il Suo link o codice QR su Instagram, Google e sul Suo sito web. Gli orari prenotati vengono bloccati automaticamente e, quando una giornata è al completo, i pazienti possono iscriversi a una lista d’attesa.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"Funziona per cliniche con più medici?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Sì. Aggiunga ogni medico con i propri orari di lavoro. Gli appuntamenti vengono assegnati a un medico, lo stesso medico non può essere prenotato due volte e, nella prenotazione online, i pazienti possono scegliere un medico — oppure «qualsiasi medico».","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"Posso registrare diagnosi ICD-10?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Sì. Aggiunga una o più diagnosi a qualsiasi visita cercando per codice o nome. AAFC include l’elenco ICD-10 completo, l’elenco ufficiale del Ministero della Salute turco e le diagnosi estetiche più comuni in 10 lingue.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"La prova gratuita di 14 giorni si rinnova automaticamente?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"La prova diventa un abbonamento a pagamento di 49,99 USD al mese, a meno che non disdica prima della fine della prova. Può disdire in qualsiasi momento dalle impostazioni del Suo account App Store o Google Play.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"Posso usare AAFC con il mio team?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Sì. La funzione di accesso multiutente Le consente di invitare fino a 5 membri del team nell'account della clinica, ciascuno con autorizzazioni basate sul ruolo.","What devices does AAFC support?":"Su quali dispositivi funziona AAFC?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC funziona su iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, smartphone e tablet Android (Android 7+) e Mac con Apple Silicon. Il pannello web funziona in qualsiasi browser per pazienti, appuntamenti, contabilità, impostazioni della prenotazione online, backup ed esportazioni.","What languages are supported?":"Quali lingue sono supportate?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC è interamente localizzato in 10 lingue: turco, inglese, tedesco, francese, spagnolo, italiano, portoghese, russo, coreano e cinese — compresi i modelli dei messaggi di promemoria per clinica.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"Archiviate foto di pazienti identificabili?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"Decide Lei. AAFC è uno strumento di archiviazione sotto il Suo controllo. Consigliamo di ottenere il consenso del paziente prima di archiviare foto mediche identificabili e di rispettare la normativa locale sui dati sanitari (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, ecc.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"Pronto a organizzare il Suo archivio clinico?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Si unisca alle cliniche che documentano con sicurezza. 14 giorni gratis, nessuna carta richiesta per iniziare.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. La soluzione completa di gestione per i professionisti dell'estetica.","Product":"Prodotto","Legal":"Note legali","Privacy Policy":"Informativa sulla privacy","Terms of Service":"Termini di servizio","Account Deletion":"Eliminazione account","Contact":"Contatti","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"Come porto i dati dal mio vecchio programma?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"Elenco pazienti, storico visite e foto si possono portare da qualsiasi programma. Da computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORTA, in 3 passi: 1) Pazienti: esporta l'elenco in Excel/CSV e caricalo; abbina nome, telefono, codice e vecchio n. paziente. 2) Storico visite: carica l'elenco trattamenti/sedute in Excel/CSV; ogni riga viene aggiunta al paziente con data, trattamento e note. 3) Foto: scegli la cartella (o ZIP) delle foto del vecchio programma; le cartelle vengono abbinate per nome o n. paziente, la data viene dal nome cartella/file o dalla foto e le foto dello stesso giorno formano una visita. I duplicati vengono saltati e ogni importazione si può annullare. Se non riesci a esportare, scrivi a support@aafclinic.com e lo trasferiamo insieme."},"pt":{"What's new":"Novidades","Features":"Funcionalidades","Pricing":"Preços","Privacy":"Privacidade","Login":"Entrar","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"O arquivo completo para<br><span>clínicas de estética</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Fotografias de pacientes, marcações com agendamento online, lembretes por WhatsApp, portal do paciente, diagnósticos CID-10 e contabilidade — no telemóvel, no tablet e no navegador. Criado por um médico, para médicos.","Download on App Store":"Descarregar na App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Disponível no Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Tudo o que a sua clínica precisa, numa só aplicação","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Captura de fotografias em cinco ângulos","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Comparador Antes/Depois e Colagem","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Agenda de Marcações e Registo Diário","Online Booking Page":"Página de Marcação Online","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Agenda Multi-Médico, Salas e Equipamentos","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"Lembretes por WhatsApp e SMS","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Links de Confirmação / Cancelamento e Controlo de Faltas","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Formulário de Saúde Pré-Consulta","Patient Portal":"Portal do Paciente","Digital Consent Forms":"Consentimentos digitais","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"Diagnósticos CID-10","Session Packages":"Pacotes de Sessões","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Contabilidade, Prestações e Fecho do Dia","Stock Tracking":"Controlo de Stock","Recall Reminders":"Lembretes de Retorno","Secure Photo Share Links":"Links Seguros de Partilha de Fotografias","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"Códigos QR para Marcações e Redes Sociais","Branded PDF Reports":"Relatórios PDF personalizados","Real-Time Statistics":"Estatísticas em tempo real","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Acesso multiutilizador à clínica","Web Panel":"Painel web","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 Idiomas, Indicativos Internacionais","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Mobile + Web, os seus dados","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"Os seus dados são <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">seus</span>. Sempre.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Sem demonstrações comerciais, sem fidelização. Capture no telemóvel, faça a gestão a partir de qualquer navegador e exporte todo o seu arquivo quando quiser.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Mobile + painel web","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Fotografe no telemóvel e reveja e gira tudo no painel web — totalmente sincronizado.","Export Anytime":"Exporte quando quiser","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Descarregue o seu arquivo completo — pacientes, visitas e fotografias — em ZIP, HTML, JSON ou CSV. É seu.","Start in 5 Minutes":"Comece em 5 minutos","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Descarregue, inicie sessão e adicione o primeiro paciente. Sem chamada de demonstração, sem taxa de adesão, sem esperar por uma equipa comercial.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"Da primeira marcação<br>ao último acompanhamento","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"O AAFC evoluiu de um arquivo fotográfico para um sistema clínico completo. Tudo o que se segue funciona na aplicação móvel e no painel web.","Online booking":"Marcação online","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"A sua própria página de marcações para o Instagram, o Google e o seu website. O paciente escolhe o serviço, o médico e o horário livre; a marcação aparece de imediato na sua agenda.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Médicos, salas e equipamentos","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"Cada médico com o seu horário e a sua cor. O mesmo médico, sala ou laser nunca pode ser marcado duas vezes ao mesmo tempo — na aplicação ou online.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Confirmar, cancelar, comparecer","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"Os lembretes incluem um link de confirmação / cancelamento com um só toque. Os cancelamentos chegam-lhe de imediato; o histórico de faltas aparece em cada marcação.","Pre-visit health form":"Formulário de saúde pré-consulta","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Antes da consulta, o paciente preenche no telemóvel alergias, medicação, gravidez e procedimentos anteriores. Os riscos são assinalados no ecrã da consulta.","Patient portal":"Portal do paciente","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Um link privado por paciente: próximas marcações, pacotes, consentimentos assinados e as fotografias que decidir partilhar. Protegido por PIN.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"Diagnósticos CID-10","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Pesquise entre 15.000+ códigos por código ou nome. Inclui a lista oficial do Ministério da Saúde da Turquia e diagnósticos estéticos em 10 idiomas.","Packages & accounting":"Pacotes e contabilidade","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Venda pacotes de sessões, acompanhe prestações e valores a receber, registe receitas e despesas e feche a caixa no fim do dia.","Photo share links":"Links de partilha de fotografias","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Envie ao paciente as fotografias antes/depois que escolher, através de um link privado e temporário — sem capturas de ecrã em conversas de WhatsApp.","QR codes":"Códigos QR","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Códigos QR prontos a imprimir para a sua página de marcações, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp e avaliações Google — para a receção e os cartões de visita.","Before & After Collage":"Colagem Antes e Depois","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Colagem Antes e Depois<br>feita para as redes sociais","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Colagens personalizadas com logótipo e datas. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — todos os formatos de que o seu feed precisa.","Built for":"Feito para","Plastic Surgery":"Cirurgia Plástica","Dermatology":"Dermatologia","Aesthetic Medicine":"Medicina Estética","ENT":"ORL","Cosmetic Clinics":"Clínicas de Estética","Visual Comparison Slider":"Deslizador de comparação visual","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Arraste para comparar<br>antes e depois","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"A funcionalidade decisiva nas consultas. Deslize entre duas visitas para revelar a evolução em tempo real — ideal para mostrar resultados aos pacientes nos controlos.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Deslizador antes/depois interativo e fluido","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Guarde o resultado na galeria do telemóvel","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Ângulos padronizados para uma comparação rigorosa","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Comparação lado a lado","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Cinco ângulos padronizados,<br>comparação instantânea","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Frente, esquerda 45°, direita 45°, perfil esquerdo, perfil direito — o protocolo clínico de cinco ângulos usado por profissionais de estética em todo o mundo. Compare duas visitas num só olhar.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Sobreposição fantasma durante a captura para ângulos consistentes","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Grelha de duas visitas nos cinco ângulos","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Ideal para consultas de controlo","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Relatórios prontos a imprimir<br>num só toque","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Cada exportação inclui o logótipo, a morada, o nome do médico e os contactos da sua clínica. Relatórios de várias páginas formatados automaticamente, prontos para imprimir, enviar por WhatsApp ou e-mail.","Clinic branding on every page":"Identidade da clínica em todas as páginas","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Nome do médico, especialidade e contactos","Share via system print or messaging":"Partilhe por impressão ou mensagens","Daily Patient Log":"Registo diário de pacientes","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Agenda diária<br>e registo de visitas","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Cada procedimento, cada paciente, todos os dias — registados automaticamente. Navegue no calendário para ver exatamente quem foi tratado e o que foi feito em qualquer dia.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Calendário com os dias de tratamento assinalados","Procedure list per day":"Lista de procedimentos por dia","PDF export of any daily log":"Exportação em PDF de qualquer registo diário","Appointment Book":"Agenda de consultas","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Consultas com<br>lembretes por WhatsApp e SMS","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Marque consultas num calendário e envie lembretes aos pacientes por WhatsApp ou SMS — com um toque. Personalize a mensagem de lembrete da clínica para manter uma voz de marca consistente.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Gestão de consultas baseada em calendário","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp click-to-chat (sem custos de SMS)","SMS option with customizable templates":"Opção SMS com modelos personalizáveis","Per-clinic message customization":"Mensagens personalizadas por clínica","Patient Database":"Base de dados de pacientes","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Todos os seus pacientes,<br>a um toque","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Deixe de procurar no rolo da câmara. Cada paciente e cada visita organizados numa lista única e clara, com pesquisa instantânea.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Pesquisa rápida por nome, apelido ou telefone","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"Aniversário, contactos e cidade num só lugar","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Número de visitas e acompanhamento de controlos","Clinic Dashboard":"Painel da clínica","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"A sua clínica<br>num relance","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Número de pacientes, visitas recentes, agenda de hoje, próximas consultas — toda a atividade da clínica num único ecrã. Configure armazenamento, utilizadores, idioma e identidade visual num só painel.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Estatísticas da clínica em tempo real","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"Até 5 membros da equipa com acesso por funções","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 idiomas, conforme o RGPD e a KVKK","Web Browser Access":"Acesso pelo navegador","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Aceda aos seus dados<br>em qualquer navegador","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"Precisa de descarregar um ano de registos? Abra os seus dados em qualquer computador. Adicione pacientes, faça cópias de segurança e exporte tudo em vários formatos — sem tocar no telemóvel.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Descarga encriptada no navegador","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"Exportações em JSON, CSV, HTML e ZIP","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Pacientes, marcações, contabilidade e definições de marcação online","Patient-organized folder structure":"Estrutura de pastas organizada por paciente","Your Brand Everywhere":"A sua marca em todo o lado","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Logótipo, morada e contactos<br>em todos os relatórios","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"A identidade da sua clínica é aplicada automaticamente a cada PDF e fotografia partilhada: nome da clínica, perfil do médico, especialidade, contactos e redes sociais. Armazenamento na nuvem com cópia de segurança automática todas as noites no Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Carregue o logótipo da sua clínica","Doctor name and specialty":"Nome do médico e especialidade","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Telefone, Instagram, link do website","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Cópia de segurança automática noturna na nuvem","Simple, transparent pricing":"Preços simples e transparentes","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Uma subscrição. Todas as funcionalidades incluídas. Cancele quando quiser.","14-Day Free Trial":"14 dias de teste gratuito","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"O arquivo completo da sua clínica de estética.","/ month":"/ mês","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"Experimente grátis durante 14 dias. Cancele a qualquer momento nas definições da sua conta."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Pacientes, fotografias e visitas ilimitados"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Captura com sobreposição fantasma e deslizador de comparação"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Registo diário de pacientes e agenda de consultas"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" Lembretes por WhatsApp e SMS"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Página de marcação online, agenda multi-médico"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Portal do paciente, formulários de saúde e consentimentos digitais"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" Diagnósticos CID-10, pacotes, contabilidade e stock"," Branded PDF reports":" Relatórios PDF personalizados"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Cópia de segurança segura na nuvem (noturna)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Acesso multiutilizador à clínica (até 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Acesso aos dados pelo navegador e exportação completa"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 idiomas, conforme o RGPD e a KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"Iniciar teste gratuito - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Iniciar teste gratuito - Android","Frequently asked":"Perguntas frequentes","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Tudo o que precisa de saber sobre a AAFC.","Is my patient data secure?":"Os dados dos meus pacientes estão seguros?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Sim. Todas as fotografias e registos de pacientes são encriptados em trânsito e em repouso. A AAFC armazena os dados na infraestrutura segura da Supabase com segurança ao nível da linha e faz cópias de segurança automáticas todas as noites no Cloudflare R2. Nunca partilhamos dados com terceiros nem anunciantes. Pode exportar todos os seus dados a qualquer momento e pedir a eliminação da conta através da nossa página de eliminação.","Who is AAFC for?":"A quem se destina a AAFC?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"A AAFC destina-se a profissionais de saúde habilitados: cirurgiões plásticos, dermatologistas, otorrinolaringologistas, médicos de estética e equipas de clínicas. É uma ferramenta de documentação e arquivo; não fornece orientação de diagnóstico ou tratamento.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"Como funcionam os lembretes por WhatsApp?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Toque na consulta de um paciente e depois no botão WhatsApp — a sua mensagem de lembrete personalizável abre diretamente no WhatsApp com o número do paciente já preenchido. Envie com um toque. Usa o click-to-chat do WhatsApp, por isso não há custo por mensagem. Também pode enviar por SMS através das mensagens do seu telemóvel.","Can patients book appointments online?":"Os pacientes podem marcar consultas online?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Sim. Ative a marcação online, escolha os serviços, as durações e o horário de funcionamento e partilhe o seu link ou código QR no Instagram, no Google e no seu website. Os horários ocupados são bloqueados automaticamente e, quando um dia está cheio, o paciente pode inscrever-se numa lista de espera.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"Funciona em clínicas com vários médicos?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Sim. Adicione cada médico com o seu próprio horário. As marcações são atribuídas a um médico, o mesmo médico não pode ter duas marcações à mesma hora e, na marcação online, o paciente pode escolher um médico — ou «qualquer médico».","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"Posso registar diagnósticos CID-10?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Sim. Adicione um ou mais diagnósticos a qualquer consulta, pesquisando por código ou nome. O AAFC inclui a lista CID-10 completa, a lista oficial do Ministério da Saúde da Turquia e diagnósticos estéticos frequentes em 10 idiomas.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"O teste gratuito de 14 dias renova-se automaticamente?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"O teste converte-se numa subscrição paga de 49.99 USD por mês, salvo se cancelar antes do fim do período de teste. Pode cancelar a qualquer momento nas definições da sua conta da App Store ou do Google Play.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"Posso usar a AAFC com a minha equipa?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Sim. A funcionalidade de acesso multiutilizador permite convidar até 5 membros da equipa para a conta da sua clínica, cada um com permissões por função.","What devices does AAFC support?":"Que dispositivos a AAFC suporta?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"O AAFC funciona em iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, telemóveis e tablets Android (Android 7+) e Macs com Apple Silicon. O painel web funciona em qualquer navegador para pacientes, marcações, contabilidade, definições de marcação online, cópias de segurança e exportações.","What languages are supported?":"Que idiomas são suportados?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"A AAFC está totalmente traduzida em 10 idiomas: turco, inglês, alemão, francês, espanhol, italiano, português, russo, coreano e chinês — incluindo os modelos de mensagens de lembrete por clínica.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"Guardam fotografias de pacientes identificáveis?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"Decide o utilizador. A AAFC é uma ferramenta de arquivo sob o seu controlo. Recomendamos obter o consentimento do paciente antes de guardar fotografias médicas identificáveis e cumprir a legislação local sobre dados de saúde (KVKK, RGPD, HIPAA, etc.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"Pronto para organizar o seu arquivo clínico?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Junte-se às clínicas que documentam com confiança. 14 dias grátis, sem cartão para começar.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. A gestão clínica completa para profissionais de estética.","Product":"Produto","Legal":"Informação legal","Privacy Policy":"Política de Privacidade","Terms of Service":"Termos de Serviço","Account Deletion":"Eliminação da conta","Contact":"Contacto","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"Como trago meus dados do programa antigo?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"Lista de pacientes, histórico de visitas e fotos podem vir de qualquer programa. No computador, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORTAR, em 3 passos: 1) Pacientes: exporte a lista para Excel/CSV e envie; associe nome, telefone, documento e nº antigo do paciente. 2) Histórico de visitas: envie a lista de tratamentos/sessões em Excel/CSV; cada linha é adicionada ao paciente com data, procedimento e observações. 3) Fotos: escolha a pasta (ou ZIP) de fotos do programa antigo; as pastas são associadas por nome ou nº do paciente, a data vem do nome da pasta/arquivo ou da foto, e fotos do mesmo dia formam uma visita. Duplicados são ignorados e cada importação pode ser desfeita. Se não conseguir exportar, escreva para support@aafclinic.com e migramos juntos."},"ru":{"What's new":"Что нового","Features":"Возможности","Pricing":"Цены","Privacy":"Конфиденциальность","Login":"Вход","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"Полный архив для<br><span>эстетических клиник</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"Фото пациентов, запись с онлайн-бронированием, напоминания в WhatsApp, портал пациента, диагнозы по МКБ-10 и учёт финансов — на телефоне, планшете и в браузере. Создано врачом для врачей.","Download on App Store":"Загрузить в App Store","Get it on Google Play":"Доступно в Google Play","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"Всё, что нужно Вашей клинике, — в одном приложении","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"Съёмка в пяти ракурсах","Before/After Slider & Collage":"Слайдер «до/после» и коллаж","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"Журнал записи и ежедневный учёт","Online Booking Page":"Страница онлайн-записи","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"Календарь для нескольких врачей, кабинеты и аппараты","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"Напоминания в WhatsApp и по SMS","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"Ссылки подтверждения / отмены и учёт неявок","Pre-Visit Health Form":"Анкета здоровья перед визитом","Patient Portal":"Портал пациента","Digital Consent Forms":"Цифровые информированные согласия","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"Диагнозы по МКБ-10","Session Packages":"Абонементы на процедуры","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"Бухгалтерия, рассрочка и закрытие дня","Stock Tracking":"Учёт склада","Recall Reminders":"Напоминания о повторном визите","Secure Photo Share Links":"Защищённые ссылки для обмена фото","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"QR-коды для записи и соцсетей","Branded PDF Reports":"PDF-отчёты с Вашим брендом","Real-Time Statistics":"Статистика в реальном времени","Multi-User Clinic Access":"Многопользовательский доступ","Web Panel":"Веб-панель","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 языков, международные телефонные коды","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"Мобильное + веб, Ваши данные","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"Ваши данные — <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">Ваши</span>. Всегда.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"Без демо от отдела продаж, без привязки. Снимайте на телефон, управляйте из любого браузера и экспортируйте весь архив, когда захотите.","Mobile + Web Panel":"Мобильное приложение + веб-панель","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"Снимайте на телефон, просматривайте и управляйте всем в веб-панели — с полной синхронизацией.","Export Anytime":"Экспорт в любое время","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"Скачайте весь архив — пациентов, визиты и фото — в формате ZIP, HTML, JSON или CSV. Он принадлежит Вам.","Start in 5 Minutes":"Начните за 5 минут","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"Скачайте, войдите, добавьте первого пациента. Без демо-звонков, платы за подключение и ожидания отдела продаж.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"От первой записи<br>до последнего контрольного визита","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC вырос из фотоархива в полноценную систему для клиники. Всё описанное ниже работает и в мобильном приложении, и в веб-панели.","Online booking":"Онлайн-запись","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"Ваша собственная страница записи для Instagram, Google и Вашего сайта. Пациент выбирает услугу, врача и свободное время — запись сразу появляется в Вашем журнале.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"Врачи, кабинеты и аппараты","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"У каждого врача свой график и свой цвет. Один и тот же врач, кабинет или лазер не может быть занят дважды в одно время — ни в приложении, ни при онлайн-записи.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"Подтверждение, отмена, явка","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"В напоминаниях есть ссылка для подтверждения / отмены в одно касание. Об отменах Вы узнаёте сразу; история неявок видна в каждой записи.","Pre-visit health form":"Анкета перед визитом","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"Перед визитом пациент заполняет на телефоне сведения об аллергиях, лекарствах, беременности и прошлых процедурах. Риски отмечаются на экране визита.","Patient portal":"Портал пациента","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"Одна личная ссылка для каждого пациента: предстоящие записи, абонементы, подписанные согласия и фото, которыми Вы решили поделиться. Защищено PIN-кодом.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"Диагнозы по МКБ-10","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Поиск по 15 000+ кодам — по коду или названию. Включает официальный список Министерства здравоохранения Турции и эстетические диагнозы на 10 языках.","Packages & accounting":"Абонементы и бухгалтерия","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"Продавайте абонементы на процедуры, отслеживайте рассрочки и задолженности, вносите доходы и расходы и закрывайте кассу в конце дня.","Photo share links":"Ссылки для обмена фото","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"Отправляйте пациенту выбранные фото «до/после» по личной ссылке с ограниченным сроком действия — без скриншотов в переписке WhatsApp.","QR codes":"QR-коды","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"Готовые к печати QR-коды для страницы записи, Instagram, TikTok, сайта, WhatsApp и отзывов в Google — для стойки администратора и визиток.","Before & After Collage":"Коллаж «до и после»","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"Коллаж «до и после»<br>для соцсетей","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"Коллажи с логотипом и датами. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — любые форматы для Вашей ленты.","Built for":"Для","Plastic Surgery":"Пластической хирургии","Dermatology":"Дерматологии","Aesthetic Medicine":"Эстетической медицины","ENT":"ЛОР","Cosmetic Clinics":"Косметологических клиник","Visual Comparison Slider":"Слайдер визуального сравнения","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"Потяните, чтобы сравнить<br>до и после","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"Главная функция для консультаций. Перемещайте слайдер между двумя визитами и показывайте динамику в реальном времени — идеально для демонстрации результатов на контрольных визитах.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"Плавный интерактивный слайдер до/после","Save the result to your phone gallery":"Сохранение результата в галерею телефона","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"Стандартизированные ракурсы для точного сравнения","Side-by-Side Comparison":"Сравнение бок о бок","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"Пять стандартных ракурсов,<br>мгновенное сравнение","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"Анфас, слева 45°, справа 45°, левый профиль, правый профиль — клинический протокол пяти ракурсов, принятый специалистами эстетической медицины по всему миру. Сравнивайте любые два визита с одного взгляда.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"Полупрозрачное наложение при съёмке для точного ракурса","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"Сетка двух визитов по всем пяти ракурсам","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"Идеально для контрольных консультаций","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"Отчёты для печати<br>в одно касание","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"Каждый экспорт содержит логотип клиники, адрес, имя врача и контакты. Автоматически оформленные многостраничные отчёты для печати, WhatsApp или e-mail.","Clinic branding on every page":"Брендинг клиники на каждой странице","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"Имя врача, специальность и контакты","Share via system print or messaging":"Печать или отправка в мессенджеры","Daily Patient Log":"Ежедневный журнал пациентов","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"Ежедневник<br>и журнал визитов","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"Каждая процедура, каждый пациент, каждый день — всё фиксируется автоматически. Выберите дату в календаре и узнайте, кого принимали и что было сделано.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"Календарь с отмеченными днями процедур","Procedure list per day":"Список процедур за день","PDF export of any daily log":"Экспорт любого дня в PDF","Appointment Book":"Журнал записи","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"Записи с напоминаниями<br>в WhatsApp и по SMS","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"Записывайте пациентов в календаре и отправляйте напоминания в WhatsApp или по SMS — в одно касание. Настройте текст напоминания для единого стиля клиники.","Calendar-based appointment management":"Управление записями в календаре","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp click-to-chat (без затрат на SMS)","SMS option with customizable templates":"SMS с настраиваемыми шаблонами","Per-clinic message customization":"Свои тексты сообщений для каждой клиники","Patient Database":"База пациентов","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"Все Ваши пациенты —<br>в одно касание","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"Хватит искать в галерее телефона. Все пациенты и визиты в одном аккуратном списке с мгновенным поиском.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"Быстрый поиск по имени, фамилии или телефону","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"День рождения, контакты и город в одном месте","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"Количество визитов и контроль наблюдения","Clinic Dashboard":"Панель клиники","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"Ваша клиника<br>с одного взгляда","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"Число пациентов, последние визиты, план на сегодня, предстоящие записи — вся активность клиники на одном экране. Хранилище, пользователи, язык и брендинг настраиваются в одной панели.","Real-time clinic statistics":"Статистика клиники в реальном времени","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"До 5 сотрудников с доступом по ролям","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10 языков, соответствие GDPR и KVKK","Web Browser Access":"Доступ из браузера","Access your data<br>from any browser":"Доступ к данным<br>из любого браузера","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"Нужно скачать записи за год? Откройте свои данные в браузере на любом компьютере. Добавляйте пациентов, делайте резервные копии и экспортируйте всё в разных форматах — не касаясь телефона.","Encrypted browser-side download":"Зашифрованная загрузка в браузере","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"Экспорт в JSON, CSV, HTML и ZIP","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"Пациенты, записи, бухгалтерия и настройки онлайн-записи","Patient-organized folder structure":"Структура папок по пациентам","Your Brand Everywhere":"Ваш бренд повсюду","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"Логотип, адрес, контакты<br>в каждом отчёте","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"Фирменный стиль клиники автоматически применяется к каждому PDF и отправленному фото: название клиники, профиль врача, специальность, контакты и соцсети. Облачное хранилище с автоматическим ночным резервным копированием в Cloudflare R2.","Upload custom clinic logo":"Загрузка собственного логотипа клиники","Doctor name and specialty":"Имя врача и специальность","Phone, Instagram, web link":"Телефон, Instagram, ссылка на сайт","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"Автоматическое ночное резервное копирование","Simple, transparent pricing":"Простые и прозрачные цены","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"Одна подписка. Все функции включены. Отмена в любой момент.","14-Day Free Trial":"14 дней бесплатно","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"Полный архив Вашей эстетической клиники.","/ month":"/ месяц","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"Попробуйте бесплатно 14 дней. Отменить можно в любой момент в настройках аккаунта."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" Неограниченное число пациентов, фото и визитов"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" Съёмка с наложением и слайдер сравнения"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" Ежедневный журнал пациентов и журнал записи"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" Напоминания в WhatsApp и по SMS"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" Страница онлайн-записи, календарь для нескольких врачей"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" Портал пациента, анкеты здоровья и электронные согласия"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" Диагнозы по МКБ-10, абонементы, бухгалтерия и склад"," Branded PDF reports":" PDF-отчёты с Вашим брендом"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" Надёжное облачное резервное копирование (ночное)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" Многопользовательский доступ (до 5)"," Web browser data access & full export":" Доступ к данным из браузера и полный экспорт"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10 языков, соответствие GDPR и KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"Начать пробный период - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"Начать пробный период - Android","Frequently asked":"Частые вопросы","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"Всё, что нужно знать об AAFC.","Is my patient data secure?":"Защищены ли данные моих пациентов?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"Да. Все фото и записи пациентов шифруются при передаче и хранении. AAFC хранит данные в защищённой инфраструктуре Supabase с защитой на уровне строк и ежедневно ночью автоматически создаёт резервные копии в Cloudflare R2. Мы никогда не передаём данные третьим лицам или рекламодателям. Вы можете экспортировать все данные в любой момент и запросить удаление аккаунта на нашей странице удаления.","Who is AAFC for?":"Для кого создан AAFC?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC создан для лицензированных медицинских специалистов: пластических хирургов, дерматологов, оториноларингологов, врачей эстетической медицины и команд клиник. Это инструмент документирования и архивирования; он не даёт рекомендаций по диагностике или лечению.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"Как работают напоминания в WhatsApp?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"Нажмите на запись пациента, затем на кнопку WhatsApp — Ваш настраиваемый текст напоминания откроется прямо в WhatsApp с уже указанным номером пациента. Отправка в одно касание. Используется функция click-to-chat WhatsApp, поэтому сообщения бесплатны. Также можно отправить SMS через стандартное приложение сообщений телефона.","Can patients book appointments online?":"Могут ли пациенты записываться онлайн?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"Да. Включите онлайн-запись, выберите услуги, их длительность и часы работы и разместите свою ссылку или QR-код в Instagram, Google и на сайте. Занятое время блокируется автоматически, а если день заполнен, пациент может встать в лист ожидания.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"Подходит ли система для клиник с несколькими врачами?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"Да. Добавьте каждого врача с его собственным графиком. Записи закрепляются за врачом, одному врачу нельзя назначить две записи на одно время, а при онлайн-записи пациент может выбрать врача — или «любого врача».","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"Можно ли вносить диагнозы по МКБ-10?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"Да. Добавляйте один или несколько диагнозов к любому визиту, выполняя поиск по коду или названию. AAFC содержит полный перечень МКБ-10, официальный список Министерства здравоохранения Турции и распространённые эстетические диагнозы на 10 языках.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"Продлевается ли 14-дневный пробный период автоматически?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"По окончании пробного периода подписка становится платной — 49.99 USD в месяц, если Вы не отмените её до конца пробного периода. Отменить можно в любой момент в настройках аккаунта App Store или Google Play.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"Можно ли использовать AAFC вместе с командой?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"Да. Функция многопользовательского доступа позволяет пригласить до 5 сотрудников в аккаунт клиники, каждому — с правами по роли.","What devices does AAFC support?":"Какие устройства поддерживает AAFC?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC работает на iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, телефонах и планшетах Android (Android 7+) и компьютерах Mac на Apple Silicon. Веб-панель работает в любом браузере: пациенты, записи, бухгалтерия, настройки онлайн-записи, резервные копии и экспорт.","What languages are supported?":"Какие языки поддерживаются?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC полностью локализован на 10 языков: турецкий, английский, немецкий, французский, испанский, итальянский, португальский, русский, корейский и китайский — включая шаблоны напоминаний для каждой клиники.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"Храните ли Вы фото пациентов, по которым их можно идентифицировать?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"Решаете Вы. AAFC — архив под Вашим контролем. Рекомендуем получать согласие пациента перед хранением медицинских фото, позволяющих его идентифицировать, и соблюдать местные требования к медицинским данным (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA и др.).","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"Готовы упорядочить свой клинический архив?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"Присоединяйтесь к клиникам, которые ведут документацию уверенно. 14 дней бесплатно, карта для начала не нужна.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. Полноценное управление клиникой для специалистов эстетической медицины.","Product":"Продукт","Legal":"Правовая информация","Privacy Policy":"Политика конфиденциальности","Terms of Service":"Условия использования","Account Deletion":"Удаление аккаунта","Contact":"Контакты","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"Как перенести данные из старой программы?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"Список пациентов, историю визитов и фото можно перенести из любой программы. С компьютера: aafclinic.com/panel > ИМПОРТ, 3 шага: 1) Пациенты: выгрузите список в Excel/CSV и загрузите; сопоставьте имя, телефон, номер документа и старый номер пациента. 2) История визитов: загрузите список процедур/сеансов в Excel/CSV; каждая строка добавляется пациенту с датой, процедурой и заметками. 3) Фото: выберите папку (или ZIP) с фото старой программы; папки сопоставляются с пациентами по имени или номеру, дата берётся из имени папки/файла или из фото, фото одного дня образуют визит. Дубликаты пропускаются, любой импорт можно отменить. Не получается выгрузить? Напишите на support@aafclinic.com — перенесём вместе."},"ko":{"What's new":"새로운 기능","Features":"기능","Pricing":"요금제","Privacy":"개인정보","Login":"로그인","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"미용 클리닉을 위한<br><span>완벽한 아카이브</span>","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"환자 사진, 온라인 예약이 가능한 예약 관리, WhatsApp 알림, 환자 포털, ICD-10 진단, 회계까지 — 휴대폰, 태블릿, 브라우저에서 모두 사용할 수 있습니다. 의사가 의사를 위해 만들었습니다.","Download on App Store":"App Store에서 다운로드","Get it on Google Play":"Google Play에서 받기","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"클리닉에 필요한 모든 것을 하나의 앱으로","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"5방향 사진 촬영","Before/After Slider & Collage":"전/후 비교 슬라이더 및 콜라주","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"예약 장부 및 일일 기록","Online Booking Page":"온라인 예약 페이지","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"다중 의사 캘린더, 진료실 및 장비","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"WhatsApp 및 SMS 알림","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"확인 / 취소 링크 및 노쇼 관리","Pre-Visit Health Form":"방문 전 건강 설문지","Patient Portal":"환자 포털","Digital Consent Forms":"전자 동의서","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"ICD-10 진단","Session Packages":"시술 패키지","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"회계, 할부 및 일일 마감","Stock Tracking":"재고 관리","Recall Reminders":"재방문 알림","Secure Photo Share Links":"안전한 사진 공유 링크","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"예약 및 SNS용 QR 코드","Branded PDF Reports":"브랜드 PDF 보고서","Real-Time Statistics":"실시간 통계","Multi-User Clinic Access":"다중 사용자 클리닉 접근","Web Panel":"웹 패널","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10개 언어, 국제 전화번호 코드","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"모바일 + 웹, 데이터는 내 것","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"데이터는 <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">여러분의 것</span>입니다. 언제나.","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"영업 데모도, 종속도 없습니다. 휴대폰으로 촬영하고, 어떤 브라우저에서든 관리하고, 원할 때 언제든 전체 아카이브를 내보내세요.","Mobile + Web Panel":"모바일 + 웹 패널","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"현장에서는 휴대폰으로 촬영하고, 검토와 관리는 웹 패널에서 — 완벽하게 동기화됩니다.","Export Anytime":"언제든 내보내기","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"환자, 방문, 사진 등 전체 아카이브를 ZIP, HTML, JSON 또는 CSV로 다운로드하세요. 영구히 보관할 수 있습니다.","Start in 5 Minutes":"5분 만에 시작","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"다운로드하고, 로그인하고, 첫 환자를 추가하세요. 데모 통화도, 온보딩 비용도, 영업팀 대기도 없습니다.","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"첫 예약부터<br>마지막 경과 관찰까지","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC는 사진 아카이브에서 완전한 클리닉 시스템으로 발전했습니다. 아래의 모든 기능은 모바일 앱과 웹 패널에서 모두 작동합니다.","Online booking":"온라인 예약","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"Instagram, Google, 병원 웹사이트에 연결할 수 있는 전용 예약 페이지입니다. 환자가 시술, 의사, 빈 시간을 선택하면 예약이 즉시 예약 장부에 반영됩니다.","Doctors, rooms & devices":"의사, 진료실 및 장비","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"의사마다 고유한 진료 시간과 색상을 지정합니다. 같은 의사, 진료실 또는 레이저 장비는 앱에서든 온라인에서든 중복 예약될 수 없습니다.","Confirm, cancel, show up":"확인, 취소, 내원","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"알림에는 한 번의 탭으로 확인 / 취소할 수 있는 링크가 포함됩니다. 취소 소식은 즉시 전달되며, 노쇼 이력은 모든 예약에 표시됩니다.","Pre-visit health form":"방문 전 건강 설문지","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"환자는 방문 전에 휴대폰으로 알레르기, 복용 약물, 임신 여부, 이전 시술 내역을 작성합니다. 위험 요소는 진료 화면에 표시됩니다.","Patient portal":"환자 포털","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"환자마다 하나의 개인 링크: 예정된 예약, 패키지, 서명된 동의서, 그리고 공유하기로 선택한 사진을 제공합니다. PIN으로 보호됩니다.","ICD-10 diagnoses":"ICD-10 진단","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"15,000개 이상의 코드를 코드 또는 명칭으로 검색하십시오. 튀르키예 보건부 공식 목록과 10개 언어로 된 미용 진단이 포함되어 있습니다.","Packages & accounting":"패키지 및 회계","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"시술 패키지를 판매하고, 할부와 미수금을 관리하고, 수입과 지출을 기록하고, 하루가 끝나면 정산을 마감합니다.","Photo share links":"사진 공유 링크","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"선택한 전/후 사진을 기한이 있는 개인 링크로 환자에게 보내십시오 — WhatsApp 대화에 스크린샷을 남길 필요가 없습니다.","QR codes":"QR 코드","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"예약 페이지, Instagram, TikTok, 웹사이트, WhatsApp, Google 리뷰용 인쇄용 QR 코드 — 접수 데스크와 명함에 활용하십시오.","Before & After Collage":"전/후 콜라주","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"SNS를 위한<br>전후 비교 콜라주","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"로고와 날짜가 들어간 브랜드 콜라주. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — 피드에 필요한 모든 비율을 지원합니다.","Built for":"이런 분야를 위해","Plastic Surgery":"성형외과","Dermatology":"피부과","Aesthetic Medicine":"미용 의학","ENT":"이비인후과","Cosmetic Clinics":"미용 클리닉","Visual Comparison Slider":"비주얼 비교 슬라이더","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"드래그하여<br>전후 비교","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"임상 상담을 위한 핵심 기능. 두 방문 사이를 슬라이드하여 경과를 실시간으로 보여 주세요 — 경과 관찰 시 환자에게 결과를 보여 주기에 안성맞춤입니다.","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"부드러운 인터랙티브 전후 슬라이더","Save the result to your phone gallery":"결과를 휴대폰 갤러리에 저장","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"정확한 비교를 위한 표준화된 각도","Side-by-Side Comparison":"나란히 비교","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"5가지 표준 각도,<br>즉시 비교","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"정면, 좌측 45°, 우측 45°, 좌측 측면, 우측 측면 — 전 세계 미용 전문가가 사용하는 임상 5방향 프로토콜. 두 방문을 한눈에 비교하세요.","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"촬영 시 고스트 오버레이로 각도 일관성 유지","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"5가지 각도 전체를 두 방문 그리드로 보기","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"경과 관찰 상담에 최적","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"인쇄용 보고서를<br>탭 한 번으로","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"모든 내보내기에 클리닉 로고, 주소, 의사 이름, 연락처가 들어갑니다. 자동 서식의 다중 페이지 보고서를 인쇄, WhatsApp, 이메일로 바로 보낼 수 있습니다.","Clinic branding on every page":"모든 페이지에 클리닉 브랜딩","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"의사 이름, 전문 분야, 연락처","Share via system print or messaging":"시스템 인쇄 또는 메신저로 공유","Daily Patient Log":"일일 환자 일지","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"일일 일정<br>및 방문 일지","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"모든 시술, 모든 환자, 매일 — 자동으로 기록됩니다. 캘린더를 넘겨 특정 날짜에 누가 어떤 시술을 받았는지 정확히 확인하세요.","Calendar with marked treatment days":"시술일이 표시된 캘린더","Procedure list per day":"날짜별 시술 목록","PDF export of any daily log":"모든 일일 일지 PDF 내보내기","Appointment Book":"예약표","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"WhatsApp 및 SMS 알림이<br>포함된 예약","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"캘린더에서 예약을 잡고 WhatsApp 또는 SMS로 환자에게 알림을 보내세요 — 탭 한 번으로. 클리닉별로 알림 메시지를 맞춤 설정해 일관된 브랜드 톤을 유지하세요.","Calendar-based appointment management":"캘린더 기반 예약 관리","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp 클릭 투 챗 (SMS 비용 0원)","SMS option with customizable templates":"맞춤 템플릿을 지원하는 SMS 옵션","Per-clinic message customization":"클리닉별 메시지 맞춤 설정","Patient Database":"환자 데이터베이스","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"모든 환자를<br>탭 한 번으로","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"더 이상 카메라 앨범을 뒤지지 마세요. 모든 환자와 방문이 즉시 검색 가능한 깔끔한 목록 하나에 정리됩니다.","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"이름, 성, 전화번호로 빠른 검색","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"생일, 연락처, 도시를 한곳에","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"방문 횟수 및 경과 관찰 추적","Clinic Dashboard":"클리닉 대시보드","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"클리닉 현황을<br>한눈에","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"환자 수, 최근 방문, 오늘 일정, 다가오는 예약 — 클리닉의 모든 활동을 홈 화면 하나에서. 저장소, 사용자, 언어, 브랜딩을 하나의 패널에서 설정하세요.","Real-time clinic statistics":"실시간 클리닉 통계","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"역할 기반 권한으로 최대 5명의 팀원","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10개 언어, GDPR 및 KVKK 준수","Web Browser Access":"웹 브라우저 접근","Access your data<br>from any browser":"어떤 브라우저에서든<br>데이터에 접근","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"1년 치 기록을 다운로드해야 하나요? 어떤 컴퓨터 브라우저에서든 데이터를 여세요. 휴대폰 없이 환자를 추가하고, 백업을 실행하고, 다양한 형식으로 모두 내보낼 수 있습니다.","Encrypted browser-side download":"브라우저 측 암호화 다운로드","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"JSON, CSV, HTML 및 ZIP 내보내기","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"환자, 예약, 회계 및 온라인 예약 설정","Patient-organized folder structure":"환자별 폴더 구조","Your Brand Everywhere":"어디서나 우리 클리닉 브랜드","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"모든 보고서에<br>로고, 주소, 연락처","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"클리닉 정보가 모든 PDF와 공유 사진에 자동으로 반영됩니다: 클리닉명, 의사 프로필, 전문 분야, 연락처, SNS 채널. 클라우드 저장소는 매일 밤 Cloudflare R2로 자동 백업됩니다.","Upload custom clinic logo":"클리닉 로고 업로드","Doctor name and specialty":"의사 이름 및 전문 분야","Phone, Instagram, web link":"전화, Instagram, 웹 링크","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"매일 밤 자동 클라우드 백업","Simple, transparent pricing":"간단하고 투명한 요금제","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"하나의 구독으로 모든 기능 이용. 언제든 해지 가능.","14-Day Free Trial":"14일 무료 체험","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"미용 클리닉을 위한 완벽한 아카이브.","/ month":"/ 월","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"14일간 무료로 사용해 보세요. 계정 설정에서 언제든 해지할 수 있습니다."," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" 환자, 사진, 방문 무제한"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" 고스트 오버레이 촬영 및 비교 슬라이더"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" 일일 환자 일지 및 예약표"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" WhatsApp 및 SMS 알림"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" 온라인 예약 페이지, 다중 의사 캘린더"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" 환자 포털, 건강 설문지 및 전자 동의서"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" ICD-10 진단, 패키지, 회계 및 재고"," Branded PDF reports":" 브랜드 PDF 보고서"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" 안전한 클라우드 백업 (매일 밤)"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" 다중 사용자 클리닉 접근 (최대 5명)"," Web browser data access & full export":" 웹 브라우저 데이터 접근 및 전체 내보내기"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10개 언어, GDPR 및 KVKK 준수","Start free trial - iOS":"무료 체험 시작 - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"무료 체험 시작 - Android","Frequently asked":"자주 묻는 질문","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"AAFC에 대해 알아야 할 모든 것.","Is my patient data secure?":"환자 데이터는 안전한가요?","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"네. 모든 사진과 환자 기록은 전송 중과 저장 시 모두 암호화됩니다. AAFC는 행 수준 보안이 적용된 Supabase 보안 인프라에 데이터를 저장하며, 매일 밤 Cloudflare R2로 자동 백업합니다. 데이터를 제3자나 광고주와 절대 공유하지 않습니다. 언제든 전체 데이터를 내보낼 수 있으며, 삭제 페이지에서 계정 삭제를 요청할 수 있습니다.","Who is AAFC for?":"AAFC는 누구를 위한 앱인가요?","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC는 성형외과 전문의, 피부과 전문의, 이비인후과 전문의, 미용 의사, 클리닉 팀 등 면허를 보유한 의료 전문가를 위해 만들어졌습니다. 기록 및 아카이브 도구이며, 진단이나 치료 지침을 제공하지 않습니다.","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"WhatsApp 알림은 어떻게 작동하나요?","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"환자의 예약을 탭한 다음 WhatsApp 버튼을 탭하세요 — 맞춤 설정한 알림 메시지가 환자 번호가 입력된 상태로 WhatsApp에서 바로 열립니다. 탭 한 번으로 전송하세요. WhatsApp 클릭 투 챗을 사용하므로 메시지당 비용이 전혀 없습니다. 휴대폰 기본 메시지 앱으로 SMS를 보낼 수도 있습니다.","Can patients book appointments online?":"환자가 온라인으로 예약할 수 있습니까?","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"네. 온라인 예약을 켜고 시술 항목, 소요 시간, 진료 시간을 선택한 뒤 링크나 QR 코드를 Instagram, Google, 웹사이트에 공유하십시오. 예약된 시간은 자동으로 차단되며, 하루 예약이 모두 찬 경우 환자는 대기자 명단에 등록할 수 있습니다.","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"의사가 여러 명인 클리닉에서도 사용할 수 있습니까?","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"네. 의사마다 고유한 진료 시간을 설정하여 추가하십시오. 예약은 의사별로 배정되며, 같은 의사에게 중복 예약이 불가능합니다. 환자는 온라인 예약 시 의사를 선택하거나 ‘상관없음’을 선택할 수 있습니다.","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"ICD-10 진단을 기록할 수 있습니까?","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"네. 코드나 명칭으로 검색하여 모든 진료 기록에 하나 이상의 진단을 추가할 수 있습니다. AAFC에는 전체 ICD-10 목록, 튀르키예 보건부 공식 목록, 10개 언어로 된 주요 미용 진단이 포함되어 있습니다.","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"14일 무료 체험은 자동 갱신되나요?","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"체험 기간이 끝나기 전에 해지하지 않으면 월 49.99 USD 유료 구독으로 전환됩니다. App Store 또는 Google Play 계정 설정에서 언제든 해지할 수 있습니다.","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"팀과 함께 AAFC를 사용할 수 있나요?","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"네. 다중 사용자 클리닉 접근 기능으로 클리닉 계정에 최대 5명의 팀원을 초대하고 역할별 권한을 부여할 수 있습니다.","What devices does AAFC support?":"AAFC는 어떤 기기를 지원하나요?","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC는 iPhone(iOS 15+), iPad, Android 휴대폰 및 태블릿(Android 7+), Apple Silicon Mac에서 실행됩니다. 웹 패널은 모든 브라우저에서 작동하며 환자, 예약, 회계, 온라인 예약 설정, 백업 및 내보내기를 지원합니다.","What languages are supported?":"어떤 언어를 지원하나요?","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC는 터키어, 영어, 독일어, 프랑스어, 스페인어, 이탈리아어, 포르투갈어, 러시아어, 한국어, 중국어 등 10개 언어로 완전히 현지화되어 있으며, 클리닉별 알림 메시지 템플릿도 포함됩니다.","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"식별 가능한 환자 사진을 저장하나요?","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"결정은 여러분의 몫입니다. AAFC는 직접 관리하는 아카이브 도구입니다. 식별 가능한 의료 사진을 저장하기 전에 환자 동의를 받고, 해당 지역의 의료 데이터 규정(KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, 개인정보 보호법 등)을 준수하실 것을 권장합니다.","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"임상 아카이브를 체계적으로 정리할 준비가 되셨나요?","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"자신 있게 기록하는 클리닉과 함께하세요. 14일 무료, 시작할 때 카드 등록이 필요 없습니다.","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. 미용 전문가를 위한 완벽한 클리닉 관리 솔루션.","Product":"제품","Legal":"법적 고지","Privacy Policy":"개인정보 처리방침","Terms of Service":"서비스 이용약관","Account Deletion":"계정 삭제","Contact":"문의","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"이전 프로그램의 데이터는 어떻게 옮기나요?","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"환자 목록, 방문 기록, 사진을 어떤 프로그램에서든 옮길 수 있습니다. 컴퓨터에서 aafclinic.com/panel > 가져오기, 3단계: 1) 환자: 목록을 Excel/CSV로 내보내 업로드하고 이름, 전화, 신분증 번호, 이전 환자 번호 열을 연결합니다. 2) 방문 기록: 시술/세션 목록을 Excel/CSV로 업로드하면 각 행이 날짜, 시술, 메모와 함께 해당 환자에 추가됩니다. 3) 사진: 이전 프로그램의 사진 폴더(또는 ZIP)를 선택하면 환자 폴더가 이름이나 환자 번호로 연결되고, 날짜는 폴더/파일 이름이나 사진에서 가져오며 같은 날 사진은 하나의 방문이 됩니다. 중복은 건너뛰고 모든 가져오기는 취소할 수 있습니다. 내보낼 수 없다면 support@aafclinic.com으로 연락 주세요. 함께 옮겨 드립니다."},"zh":{"What's new":"新功能","Features":"功能","Pricing":"价格","Privacy":"隐私","Login":"登录","The complete archive for<br><span>aesthetic clinics</span>":"专为<br><span>医美诊所</span>打造的完整档案系统","Patient photos, appointments with online booking, WhatsApp reminders, patient portal, ICD-10 diagnoses and accounting — on your phone, tablet and in the browser. Built by a clinician, for clinicians.":"患者照片、支持在线预约的预约管理、WhatsApp 提醒、患者门户、ICD-10 诊断与财务管理——手机、平板和浏览器均可使用。由医生打造，为医生服务。","Download on App Store":"在 App Store 下载","Get it on Google Play":"在 Google Play 获取","Everything your clinic needs, one app":"诊所所需的一切，尽在一个应用","Five-Angle Photo Capture":"五角度照片拍摄","Before/After Slider & Collage":"术前/术后对比滑块与拼图","Appointment Book & Daily Log":"预约簿与每日记录","Online Booking Page":"在线预约页面","Multi-Doctor Calendar, Rooms & Devices":"多医生日历、诊室与设备","WhatsApp & SMS Reminders":"WhatsApp 和短信提醒","Confirm / Cancel Links & No-Show Tracking":"确认 / 取消链接与爽约跟踪","Pre-Visit Health Form":"就诊前健康问卷","Patient Portal":"患者门户","Digital Consent Forms":"电子知情同意书","ICD-10 Diagnoses":"ICD-10 诊断","Session Packages":"疗程套餐","Accounting, Instalments & Day Close":"财务、分期付款与日结","Stock Tracking":"库存管理","Recall Reminders":"复诊提醒","Secure Photo Share Links":"安全照片分享链接","QR Codes for Booking & Social Media":"预约与社交媒体二维码","Branded PDF Reports":"品牌 PDF 报告","Real-Time Statistics":"实时统计","Multi-User Clinic Access":"多用户诊所访问","Web Panel":"网页后台","10 Languages, International Phone Codes":"10 种语言，国际电话区号","Mobile + Web, Your Data":"移动端 + 网页，数据归您","Your data is <span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">yours</span>. Always.":"您的数据<span style=\"color:#B89A6A;font-weight:600;\">归您所有</span>。始终如此。","No sales demo, no lock-in. Capture on your phone, manage from any browser, and export your entire archive whenever you want.":"无需销售演示，没有绑定。用手机拍摄，在任意浏览器中管理，随时导出完整档案。","Mobile + Web Panel":"移动端 + 网页后台","Shoot in the field on your phone, review and manage everything from the web panel — fully synced.":"在现场用手机拍摄，在网页后台查看和管理一切 — 完全同步。","Export Anytime":"随时导出","Download your full archive — patients, visits, and photos — as ZIP, HTML, JSON, or CSV. It is yours to keep.":"以 ZIP、HTML、JSON 或 CSV 格式下载完整档案 — 患者、就诊和照片。数据永远归您。","Start in 5 Minutes":"5分钟即可开始","Download, sign in, add your first patient. No demo call, no onboarding fee, no waiting on a sales team.":"下载、登录、添加第一位患者。无需演示电话，无入门费用，无需等待销售团队。","From the first booking<br>to the last follow-up":"从首次预约<br>到最后一次复诊","AAFC grew from a photo archive into a complete clinic system. Everything below works in the mobile app and in the web panel.":"AAFC 已从照片档案发展为完整的诊所管理系统。以下所有功能均可在移动应用和网页后台中使用。","Online booking":"在线预约","Your own booking page for Instagram, Google and your website. Patients pick a service, doctor and free time; the slot appears in your appointment book instantly.":"专属预约页面，可用于 Instagram、Google 和您的网站。患者选择项目、医生和空闲时段后，预约即刻出现在您的预约簿中。","Doctors, rooms & devices":"医生、诊室与设备","Each doctor with their own hours and colour. The same doctor, room or laser can never be double-booked — in the app or online.":"每位医生拥有各自的工作时间和颜色标识。同一位医生、诊室或激光设备绝不会被重复预约——无论是在应用内还是在线预约。","Confirm, cancel, show up":"确认、取消、到诊","Reminders carry a one-tap confirm / cancel link. Cancellations reach you at once; no-show history appears on every appointment.":"提醒消息附带一键确认 / 取消链接。取消信息即时送达；每条预约都会显示爽约记录。","Pre-visit health form":"就诊前健康问卷","Patients fill in allergies, medication, pregnancy and past procedures on their phone before the visit. Risks are flagged on the visit screen.":"患者在就诊前用手机填写过敏史、用药情况、妊娠状况及既往治疗。风险项会在就诊界面中标示。","Patient portal":"患者门户","One private link per patient: upcoming appointments, packages, signed consents and the photos you choose to share. Protected with a PIN.":"每位患者一个专属链接：即将到来的预约、套餐、已签署的知情同意书以及您选择分享的照片。由 PIN 码保护。","ICD-10 diagnoses":"ICD-10 诊断","Search 15,000+ codes by code or name. Includes the official Turkish Ministry of Health list and aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"按代码或名称检索 15,000+ 个编码。包含土耳其卫生部官方列表以及 10 种语言的医美诊断。","Packages & accounting":"套餐与财务","Sell session packages, track instalments and receivables, record income and expenses, and close the cash register at the end of the day.":"销售疗程套餐，跟踪分期付款和应收账款，记录收入与支出，并在每日结束时完成日结。","Photo share links":"照片分享链接","Send selected before/after photos to a patient as a private, expiring link — no screenshots in WhatsApp threads.":"通过有时效的私密链接，将选定的术前/术后照片发送给患者——无需在 WhatsApp 对话中发送截图。","QR codes":"二维码","Print-ready QR codes for your booking page, Instagram, TikTok, website, WhatsApp and Google reviews — for the front desk and business cards.":"可直接打印的二维码，适用于预约页面、Instagram、TikTok、网站、WhatsApp 和 Google 评价——用于前台和名片。","Before & After Collage":"术前术后拼图","Before & After Collage<br>Built for Social Media":"术前术后拼图<br>专为社交媒体打造","Branded collages with logo and dates. 1:1, 4:5, 9:16, 3:4 — every aspect ratio your feed needs.":"带有标志和日期的品牌拼图。1:1、4:5、9:16、3:4 — 满足各类内容所需的所有比例。","Built for":"适用于","Plastic Surgery":"整形外科","Dermatology":"皮肤科","Aesthetic Medicine":"医学美容","ENT":"耳鼻喉科","Cosmetic Clinics":"美容诊所","Visual Comparison Slider":"可视化对比滑块","Drag to compare<br>before & after":"拖动对比<br>术前术后","The killer feature for clinical consultations. Slide between two visits to reveal progress in real time — perfect for showing results to patients during follow-ups.":"临床面诊的杀手级功能。在两次就诊之间滑动，实时呈现改善效果 — 非常适合在复查时向患者展示成果。","Smooth interactive before/after slider":"流畅的交互式术前术后滑块","Save the result to your phone gallery":"将结果保存到手机相册","Standardized angles for accurate comparison":"标准化角度，对比更精准","Side-by-Side Comparison":"并排对比","Five standardized angles,<br>instant comparison":"五个标准角度，<br>即时对比","Front, left 45°, right 45°, left profile, right profile — the clinical five-angle protocol used by aesthetic professionals worldwide. Compare any two visits in a single glance.":"正面、左45°、右45°、左侧面、右侧面 — 全球医美专业人士通用的临床五角度拍摄规范。一眼对比任意两次就诊。","Ghost overlay during capture for angle consistency":"拍摄时叠影辅助，保持角度一致","Two-visit grid view across all five angles":"五个角度的两次就诊网格视图","Ideal for follow-up consultations":"非常适合复查面诊","Print-ready reports<br>one tap away":"可直接打印的报告<br>一键生成","Every export carries your clinic logo, address, doctor name, and contact details. Auto-formatted multi-page reports ready for print, WhatsApp, or email.":"每份导出文件都带有诊所标志、地址、医生姓名和联系方式。自动排版的多页报告，可直接打印或通过 WhatsApp、电子邮件发送。","Clinic branding on every page":"每页都有诊所品牌","Doctor name, specialty, and contact":"医生姓名、专业和联系方式","Share via system print or messaging":"通过系统打印或聊天应用分享","Daily Patient Log":"每日患者日志","Daily agenda<br>and visit log":"每日日程<br>与就诊日志","Every procedure, every patient, every day — automatically logged. Navigate the calendar to see exactly who was treated and what was performed on any given day.":"每一个项目、每一位患者、每一天 — 自动记录。浏览日历，准确查看任意一天谁接受了什么治疗。","Calendar with marked treatment days":"标记治疗日期的日历","Procedure list per day":"按日显示项目列表","PDF export of any daily log":"任意每日日志均可导出 PDF","Appointment Book":"预约簿","Appointments with<br>WhatsApp & SMS reminders":"预约管理<br>配合 WhatsApp 和短信提醒","Schedule appointments on a calendar and send patients reminders via WhatsApp or SMS — in one tap. Customize your reminder message per clinic for a consistent brand voice.":"在日历上安排预约，一键通过 WhatsApp 或短信向患者发送提醒。按诊所自定义提醒消息，保持统一的品牌语调。","Calendar-based appointment management":"基于日历的预约管理","WhatsApp click-to-chat (zero SMS cost)":"WhatsApp 一键聊天（零短信费用）","SMS option with customizable templates":"短信选项，支持自定义模板","Per-clinic message customization":"按诊所自定义消息","Patient Database":"患者数据库","All your patients,<br>one tap away":"所有患者，<br>一键直达","Stop searching your camera roll. Every patient, every visit, organized in a single clean list with instant search.":"不必再翻找相册。每位患者、每次就诊都整理在一个清晰的列表中，可即时搜索。","Fast search by name, surname, or phone":"按名字、姓氏或电话快速搜索","Birthday, contact, city in one place":"生日、联系方式、城市集中查看","Visit count and follow-up tracking":"就诊次数与复查跟踪","Clinic Dashboard":"诊所仪表盘","Your clinic<br>at a glance":"诊所运营<br>一目了然","Patient count, recent visits, today's agenda, upcoming appointments — your entire clinic activity on one home screen. Configure storage, users, language, and branding from one panel.":"患者数量、近期就诊、今日日程、即将到来的预约 — 诊所全部动态尽在一个主屏幕。在一个面板中配置存储、用户、语言和品牌。","Real-time clinic statistics":"实时诊所统计","Up to 5 team members with role-based access":"最多5名团队成员，基于角色的权限","10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":"10种语言，符合 GDPR 和 KVKK","Web Browser Access":"网页浏览器访问","Access your data<br>from any browser":"在任意浏览器中<br>访问您的数据","Need to download a year of records? Open your data on any computer browser. Add patients, run backups, and export everything in multiple formats — without touching your phone.":"需要下载一整年的记录？在任意电脑浏览器中打开您的数据。无需手机即可添加患者、执行备份，并以多种格式导出全部数据。","Encrypted browser-side download":"浏览器端加密下载","JSON, CSV, HTML & ZIP exports":"JSON、CSV、HTML 和 ZIP 导出","Patients, appointments, accounting and online booking settings":"患者、预约、财务及在线预约设置","Patient-organized folder structure":"按患者分类的文件夹结构","Your Brand Everywhere":"品牌无处不在","Logo, address, contact<br>on every report":"每份报告都有<br>标志、地址和联系方式","Your clinic identity flows automatically into every PDF and shared photo: clinic name, doctor profile, specialty, contact, and social channels. Cloud storage with automatic backup, nightly to Cloudflare R2.":"诊所信息自动呈现在每份 PDF 和分享的照片中：诊所名称、医生简介、专业、联系方式和社交渠道。云存储每晚自动备份至 Cloudflare R2。","Upload custom clinic logo":"上传自定义诊所标志","Doctor name and specialty":"医生姓名和专业","Phone, Instagram, web link":"电话、Instagram、网站链接","Automatic nightly cloud backup":"每晚自动云备份","Simple, transparent pricing":"简单透明的价格","One subscription. All features unlocked. Cancel anytime.":"一个订阅，解锁全部功能。随时取消。","14-Day Free Trial":"14天免费试用","Your complete aesthetic clinic archive.":"您完整的医美诊所档案。","/ month":"/ 月","Try free for 14 days. Cancel anytime in your account settings.":"免费试用14天。可随时在账户设置中取消。"," Unlimited patients, photos & visits":" 无限患者、照片和就诊"," Ghost overlay capture & comparison slider":" 叠影拍摄与对比滑块"," Daily patient log & appointment book":" 每日患者日志与预约簿"," WhatsApp & SMS reminders":" WhatsApp 和短信提醒"," Online booking page, multi-doctor calendar":" 在线预约页面，多医生日历"," Patient portal, health forms & digital consents":" 患者门户、健康问卷与电子知情同意书"," ICD-10 diagnoses, packages, accounting & stock":" ICD-10 诊断、套餐、财务与库存"," Branded PDF reports":" 品牌 PDF 报告"," Secure cloud backup (nightly)":" 安全云备份（每晚）"," Multi-user clinic access (up to 5)":" 多用户诊所访问（最多5人）"," Web browser data access & full export":" 网页浏览器数据访问与完整导出"," 10 languages, GDPR & KVKK compliant":" 10种语言，符合 GDPR 和 KVKK","Start free trial - iOS":"开始免费试用 - iOS","Start free trial - Android":"开始免费试用 - Android","Frequently asked":"常见问题","Everything you need to know about AAFC.":"关于 AAFC 您需要了解的一切。","Is my patient data secure?":"我的患者数据安全吗？","Yes. All photos and patient records are encrypted in transit and at rest. AAFC stores data on Supabase secure infrastructure with row-level security, and runs automatic nightly backups to Cloudflare R2. We never share data with third parties or advertisers. You can export your full data anytime, and request account deletion via our deletion page.":"安全。所有照片和患者记录在传输和存储时均经过加密。AAFC 将数据存储在具备行级安全的 Supabase 安全基础设施上，并每晚自动备份至 Cloudflare R2。我们绝不会与第三方或广告商共享数据。您可随时导出全部数据，也可通过删除页面申请删除账户。","Who is AAFC for?":"AAFC 适合谁使用？","AAFC is built for licensed medical professionals: plastic surgeons, dermatologists, ENT specialists, aesthetic doctors, and clinic teams. It is a documentation and archive tool; it does not provide diagnosis or treatment guidance.":"AAFC 专为持证医疗专业人员打造：整形外科医生、皮肤科医生、耳鼻喉科专家、医美医生及诊所团队。它是一款记录与档案工具，不提供诊断或治疗指导。","How do WhatsApp reminders work?":"WhatsApp 提醒如何使用？","Tap a patient's appointment, then tap the WhatsApp button — your customizable reminder message opens directly in WhatsApp with the patient's number pre-filled. Send in one tap. This uses WhatsApp's click-to-chat, so there is zero per-message cost. You can also send via SMS using your phone's native messaging.":"点击患者的预约，再点击 WhatsApp 按钮 — 您自定义的提醒消息会直接在 WhatsApp 中打开，并已填好患者号码。一键发送。该功能使用 WhatsApp 一键聊天，因此每条消息零费用。您也可以使用手机自带的短信应用发送短信。","Can patients book appointments online?":"患者可以在线预约吗？","Yes. Turn on online booking, choose your services, durations and working hours, and share your link or QR code on Instagram, Google and your website. Booked times are blocked automatically, and patients can join a waiting list when a day is full.":"可以。开启在线预约，设置服务项目、时长和营业时间，然后在 Instagram、Google 和您的网站上分享预约链接或二维码。已被预约的时段会自动锁定；当天约满时，患者可以加入候补名单。","Does it work for clinics with several doctors?":"适用于有多位医生的诊所吗？","Yes. Add each doctor with their own working hours. Appointments are assigned to a doctor, the same doctor cannot be double-booked, and patients can choose a doctor — or \"any doctor\" — when booking online.":"适用。为每位医生分别设置工作时间。预约会分配给具体医生，同一位医生不会被重复预约；患者在线预约时可以选择医生，也可以选择“任意医生”。","Can I record ICD-10 diagnoses?":"可以记录 ICD-10 诊断吗？","Yes. Add one or more diagnoses to any visit by searching code or name. AAFC includes the full ICD-10 list, the official Turkish Ministry of Health list, and common aesthetic diagnoses in 10 languages.":"可以。通过代码或名称检索，为任意一次就诊添加一个或多个诊断。AAFC 包含完整的 ICD-10 列表、土耳其卫生部官方列表以及 10 种语言的常见医美诊断。","Does the 14-day free trial auto-renew?":"14天免费试用会自动续订吗？","The trial converts to a paid 49.99 USD per month subscription unless you cancel before the trial ends. You can cancel anytime through your App Store or Google Play account settings.":"除非您在试用期结束前取消，否则试用将转为每月 49.99 USD 的付费订阅。您可随时在 App Store 或 Google Play 账户设置中取消。","Can I use AAFC with my team?":"我可以和团队一起使用 AAFC 吗？","Yes. The Multi-User Clinic Access feature lets you invite up to 5 team members under your clinic account, each with role-based permissions.":"可以。多用户诊所访问功能让您在诊所账户下邀请最多5名团队成员，并分别设置基于角色的权限。","What devices does AAFC support?":"AAFC 支持哪些设备？","AAFC runs on iPhone (iOS 15+), iPad, Android phones and tablets (Android 7+), and Apple Silicon Macs. The web panel works in any browser for patients, appointments, accounting, online booking settings, backups and exports.":"AAFC 支持 iPhone（iOS 15+）、iPad、Android 手机和平板（Android 7+）以及 Apple Silicon Mac。网页后台可在任意浏览器中使用，涵盖患者、预约、财务、在线预约设置、备份与导出。","What languages are supported?":"支持哪些语言？","AAFC is fully localized in 10 languages: Turkish, English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Korean, and Chinese — including reminder message templates per clinic.":"AAFC 已完整本地化为10种语言：土耳其语、英语、德语、法语、西班牙语、意大利语、葡萄牙语、俄语、韩语和中文 — 包括各诊所的提醒消息模板。","Do you store photos of identifiable patients?":"你们会存储可识别身份的患者照片吗？","You decide. AAFC is an archive tool you control. We recommend obtaining patient consent before storing identifiable medical photos, and following your local medical data regulations (KVKK, GDPR, HIPAA, etc.).":"由您决定。AAFC 是由您掌控的档案工具。我们建议在存储可识别身份的医疗照片前获得患者同意，并遵守当地的医疗数据法规（KVKK、GDPR、HIPAA、《个人信息保护法》等）。","Ready to organize your clinical archive?":"准备好整理您的临床档案了吗？","Join clinics that document with confidence. 14 days free, no card needed to start.":"加入放心记录的诊所行列。14天免费，开始时无需绑定银行卡。","Aesthetic Archive for Clinics. The complete clinic management for aesthetic professionals.":"Aesthetic Archive for Clinics。面向医美专业人士的完整诊所管理方案。","Product":"产品","Legal":"法律信息","Privacy Policy":"隐私政策","Terms of Service":"服务条款","Account Deletion":"删除账户","Contact":"联系我们","How do I bring my data from my old program?":"如何从旧系统迁移数据？","Patient list, visit history and photos can be moved from any program. On a computer, aafclinic.com/panel > IMPORT, in 3 steps: 1) Patients: export the list to Excel/CSV and upload it; match name, phone, ID and old patient no columns. 2) Visit history: upload the treatment/session list as Excel/CSV; each row is added to its patient with date, procedure and notes. 3) Photos: choose the photo folder (or ZIP) of the old program; patient folders are matched by name or patient no, the date comes from the folder/file name or the photo, and photos of the same day form one visit. Duplicates are skipped and every import can be undone. If you can't export, write to support@aafclinic.com and we'll move it together.":"患者名单、就诊记录和照片都可以从任何系统迁移。在电脑上打开 aafclinic.com/panel > 导入，分 3 步：1) 患者：将名单导出为 Excel/CSV 并上传，匹配姓名、电话、证件号和旧患者编号列。2) 就诊记录：上传治疗/疗程列表（Excel/CSV），每行会连同日期、项目和备注添加到对应患者。3) 照片：选择旧系统的照片文件夹（或 ZIP），患者文件夹按姓名或患者编号匹配，日期取自文件夹/文件名或照片本身，同一天的照片组成一次就诊。重复记录会跳过，每次导入都可撤销。无法导出？请写信至 support@aafclinic.com，我们一起迁移。"}};
